WEBVTT


00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
Downloaded @ subs4free.club


00:00:01.790 --> 00:00:07.870
Over a century ago, beings that prey
on humans suddenly appeared.


00:00:09.450 --> 00:00:14.950
Their absolutely overwhelming strength...


00:00:14.950 --> 00:00:19.160
...quickly pushed humanity
to the brink of extinction.


00:00:21.330 --> 00:00:27.790
The surviving humans constructed
three walls: Maria, Rose, and Sina,


00:00:27.790 --> 00:00:31.370
which brought them a century of peace.


00:00:31.370 --> 00:00:32.790
However...


00:00:33.080 --> 00:00:38.660
{\an8}"Year 845   Shiganshina District"


00:00:41.160 --> 00:00:43.500
Humanity was suddenly reminded...


00:00:45.540 --> 00:00:48.910
...of the terror of being at their mercy...


00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:56.080
Of the humiliation of being
trapped inside a cage...


00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:32.750
They're inside!


00:01:37.080 --> 00:01:38.540
Mom!


00:01:40.750 --> 00:01:42.160
Mom!


00:01:43.910 --> 00:01:46.370
--Eren!
--Mikasa! Grab that end!


00:01:46.370 --> 00:01:48.250
We gotta move this pillar!


00:01:58.580 --> 00:02:00.870
Eren! Take Mikasa and run away!


00:02:00.870 --> 00:02:02.330
Hurry!


00:02:02.330 --> 00:02:04.120
I want to!


00:02:04.120 --> 00:02:06.750
So hurry and get out of there!


00:02:06.750 --> 00:02:10.830
The debris has crushed my legs...


00:02:10.830 --> 00:02:14.120
Even if I could get out,
I wouldn't be able to run.


00:02:14.120 --> 00:02:15.160
Can't you see?


00:02:15.160 --> 00:02:17.160
I'll carry you, then!


00:02:17.160 --> 00:02:20.410
Why don't you ever listen to your mother?!


00:02:20.410 --> 00:02:23.290
You can at least do this one last thing!


00:02:23.290 --> 00:02:25.410
Mikasa!


00:02:25.410 --> 00:02:27.080
No...


00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:28.660
No...!


00:02:30.250 --> 00:02:32.250
Hannes!


00:02:32.250 --> 00:02:35.540
Take the children and get out of here!


00:02:35.540 --> 00:02:38.410
Don't go underestimatin' me, Carla.


00:02:38.410 --> 00:02:42.700
I'm gonna slaughter these Titans
and save all three of ya!


00:02:42.700 --> 00:02:45.370
Wait! Don't fight them!


00:03:03.830 --> 00:03:05.870
Hey! Mr. Hannes!


00:03:05.870 --> 00:03:08.160
What are you doing?!


00:03:08.160 --> 00:03:11.120
Mom's still...!


00:03:11.120 --> 00:03:14.040
Eren! Mikasa!


00:03:14.040 --> 00:03:16.580
You have to survive!


00:03:25.700 --> 00:03:29.910
Stop!


00:03:55.200 --> 00:04:00.040
City districts like Shiganshina that
stick out in vital spots along the wall


00:04:00.040 --> 00:04:07.330
serve to attract the Titans and streamline
security costs and troop numbers.


00:04:07.330 --> 00:04:10.750
Performing true to its role as a Titan target,


00:04:10.750 --> 00:04:17.250
Shiganshina had but one inner gate
through which its citizens could flee.


00:04:20.620 --> 00:04:22.370
What the...?


00:04:22.370 --> 00:04:23.790
It's...!


00:04:24.870 --> 00:04:26.330
Fire!


00:04:29.040 --> 00:04:32.750
Several hours after the Colossal
Titan's appearance,


00:04:32.750 --> 00:04:37.000
the Armored Titan bulldozed
through the wall's inner gate...


00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:40.370
...shattering 100 years of peace.


00:04:40.370 --> 00:04:47.410
Humanity abandoned one third of
their territory and fled Wall Maria.


00:04:47.410 --> 00:04:50.750
You couldn't save your mother...


00:04:50.750 --> 00:04:53.450
...because you lacked the strength.


00:04:53.450 --> 00:04:56.790
I couldn't stand up to the Titan...


00:04:57.750 --> 00:05:00.620
...because I lacked the courage!


00:05:07.540 --> 00:05:10.620
I'm... going to...


00:05:10.620 --> 00:05:11.660
Eren.


00:05:11.660 --> 00:05:14.580
What's gotten into you, Eren?


00:05:14.580 --> 00:05:16.120
Eren...


00:05:17.290 --> 00:05:19.370
...drive them out!


00:05:20.330 --> 00:05:22.540
I'm going to drive out...


00:05:22.540 --> 00:05:24.910
...every last one from this world!


00:05:32.950 --> 00:05:33.750
{\an8}"Year 850   Trost District"


00:05:33.750 --> 00:05:35.580
{\an8}"Year 850   Trost District"


00:05:33.750 --> 00:05:35.580
Give your hearts!


00:05:35.580 --> 00:05:37.200
{\an8}"Year 850   Trost District"


00:05:35.580 --> 00:05:37.200
Yes, Sir!


00:05:37.200 --> 00:05:40.120
{\an8}"Year 850   Trost District"


00:05:37.200 --> 00:05:40.120
You have three options after you
graduate from the Cadets today!


00:05:40.120 --> 00:05:43.330
You have three options after you
graduate from the Cadets today!


00:05:43.330 --> 00:05:47.450
The Garrison Regiment, which reinforces
the walls and protects each city!


00:05:47.450 --> 00:05:52.040
The Scout Regiment, which risks life
and limb to venture outside the walls!


00:05:52.040 --> 00:05:57.450
And the king's Military Police Regiment,
which polices the people and preserves order!


00:05:57.450 --> 00:06:00.830
Of course, the only ones allowed
to join the Military Police


00:06:00.830 --> 00:06:04.330
are the top ten cadets
who were previously named!


00:06:07.500 --> 00:06:09.790
Five years have passed since then...


00:06:09.790 --> 00:06:13.290
We've lost a third of our land
and 20% of our people,


00:06:13.290 --> 00:06:17.000
but humanity is finally regaining its dignity!


00:06:17.000 --> 00:06:21.750
We can win! Humanity's fight
back is just beginning!


00:06:30.370 --> 00:06:31.540
Oww! Hot!


00:06:31.540 --> 00:06:32.750
What the...?!


00:06:38.750 --> 00:06:41.160
Year 850.


00:06:41.160 --> 00:06:46.750
Once again, humanity was threatened
by the Colossal Titan.


00:06:46.750 --> 00:06:51.700
You cadets have successfully graduated!
You are now proper soldiers!


00:06:51.700 --> 00:06:54.120
I have high hopes for you in this operation!


00:06:54.120 --> 00:06:56.410
Are you okay, Armin?!


00:06:56.410 --> 00:06:57.660
I'm fine!


00:06:57.660 --> 00:07:00.410
I'll calm down soon enough!


00:07:00.410 --> 00:07:02.080
Still, this is bad!


00:07:02.080 --> 00:07:07.120
We don't have the technology to
quickly seal an eight-meter-high hole!


00:07:07.120 --> 00:07:11.120
Unless we seal the hole,
this city's as good as lost!


00:07:11.120 --> 00:07:12.700
Armin!


00:07:12.700 --> 00:07:15.910
Calm down! This isn't like last time!


00:07:15.910 --> 00:07:19.540
Humanity <i>won't </i>give in to the Titans anymore!


00:07:21.200 --> 00:07:23.080
I'm sorry...


00:07:23.080 --> 00:07:24.580
I'm all right...


00:07:36.000 --> 00:07:37.950
<i>That </i>many Titans?!


00:07:39.120 --> 00:07:41.080
An Abnormal!


00:07:41.080 --> 00:07:42.330
Stop!


00:07:56.910 --> 00:07:58.290
Huh...?


00:08:07.080 --> 00:08:09.580
What the hell are you doing?!


00:08:09.580 --> 00:08:13.160
--Eren!
--Get back here, damn it!


00:08:13.160 --> 00:08:15.500
You're gonna pay for killing Thomas!


00:08:15.500 --> 00:08:19.080
I won't let you get away! I <i>won't</i>!


00:08:37.200 --> 00:08:39.330
Stop! Please don't!


00:08:39.330 --> 00:08:40.830
Why...?


00:08:40.830 --> 00:08:46.750
Why am I watching as my friends get eaten?


00:08:48.200 --> 00:08:53.910
Why... can't I move...?


00:09:01.950 --> 00:09:04.790
A-Armin...


00:09:05.700 --> 00:09:08.910
Eren! Eren!


00:09:08.910 --> 00:09:10.830
Eren!


00:09:10.830 --> 00:09:16.160
According to this book, most of the world
is covered in water called a "sea"!


00:09:16.160 --> 00:09:18.950
And this "sea" is entirely saltwater!


00:09:18.950 --> 00:09:20.540
Salt?!


00:09:20.540 --> 00:09:23.120
There's a lot more than loads of salt, too!


00:09:23.120 --> 00:09:27.620
Fiery water! Lands of ice! Sandy snowfields!


00:09:27.620 --> 00:09:32.250
The outside world must be <i>many </i>times larger
than the inside of these walls!


00:09:32.250 --> 00:09:36.910
I hope we can explore the
outside world too someday!


00:09:50.250 --> 00:09:51.580
Eren!


00:09:52.620 --> 00:09:57.290
I <i>refuse </i>to die here...


00:09:57.290 --> 00:10:03.330
I have... to see it...
The outside world...!


00:10:05.410 --> 00:10:07.830
Eren! Hurry!


00:10:27.040 --> 00:10:30.120
We live in a cruel world.


00:10:30.120 --> 00:10:33.160
A cruel world in which only the victors live.


00:10:34.120 --> 00:10:40.580
In such a world, Eren gave me
a place to call home.


00:10:40.580 --> 00:10:42.910
Warm, isn't it?


00:10:42.910 --> 00:10:48.450
That was something I couldn't bear losing again.


00:10:51.450 --> 00:10:53.790
Where's Eren?


00:10:53.790 --> 00:10:55.160
Armin?


00:11:00.830 --> 00:11:03.330
I'm sorry, Mikasa...


00:11:03.330 --> 00:11:06.950
It should've been me, not Eren...


00:11:09.620 --> 00:11:11.000
Armin.


00:11:14.250 --> 00:11:15.950
Calm down.


00:11:15.950 --> 00:11:19.370
Now isn't the time to be emotional.


00:11:20.750 --> 00:11:22.540
Now get up.


00:11:23.700 --> 00:11:26.540
If we eliminate the Titans swarming around HQ,


00:11:26.540 --> 00:11:30.290
we can replenish our gas supplies
and get over the wall.


00:11:30.290 --> 00:11:31.620
Correct?


00:11:31.620 --> 00:11:34.660
But even with your help,
there's just too many...


00:11:34.660 --> 00:11:35.750
I can handle them.


00:11:35.750 --> 00:11:37.580
Huh?!


00:11:37.580 --> 00:11:40.160
I'm strong.


00:11:40.160 --> 00:11:42.910
Stronger than all of you.


00:11:42.910 --> 00:11:44.870
I'm very strong.


00:11:44.870 --> 00:11:50.330
As such, I <i>am </i>capable of
annihilating the Titans there!


00:11:50.330 --> 00:11:52.580
Even if I have to go it alone.


00:11:52.580 --> 00:11:55.540
You're seriously gonna take on
all those Titans by yourself?!


00:11:55.540 --> 00:11:57.250
There's no way you can beat them!


00:11:57.250 --> 00:12:00.080
If I can't, then I'll die. It's that simple.


00:12:00.080 --> 00:12:02.620
But... If I win, I'll live.


00:12:02.620 --> 00:12:05.080
And the only way to win is to fight!


00:12:06.200 --> 00:12:07.410
Hey!


00:12:16.370 --> 00:12:19.160
She's not her usual, composed self at all!


00:12:19.160 --> 00:12:22.000
She's trying to distract herself
from her anguish!


00:12:23.620 --> 00:12:25.040
Mikasa!


00:12:28.750 --> 00:12:31.000
It's this again...


00:12:31.000 --> 00:12:33.580
I've lost my family again...


00:12:34.950 --> 00:12:39.540
Do I have to revisit this pain...


00:12:39.540 --> 00:12:43.750
...and start all over from here again?


00:13:00.750 --> 00:13:02.580
Huh?


00:13:02.580 --> 00:13:04.200
Why?


00:13:04.200 --> 00:13:06.290
I was sure I'd given up...


00:13:11.580 --> 00:13:15.160
Why... am I standing up?


00:13:16.160 --> 00:13:18.500
Why... am I struggling?


00:13:19.750 --> 00:13:21.660
After all...


00:13:23.200 --> 00:13:25.450
There's no point in living anymore...


00:13:26.950 --> 00:13:28.950
So what's driving me?


00:13:31.330 --> 00:13:32.950
Fight!


00:13:32.950 --> 00:13:36.660
Fight! Fight!


00:13:36.660 --> 00:13:38.080
Eren...


00:13:39.500 --> 00:13:42.160
I'm sorry, Eren...


00:13:42.160 --> 00:13:44.540
I won't give up anymore...


00:13:47.620 --> 00:13:50.120
If I die...


00:13:50.120 --> 00:13:54.200
...I'll lose my memories of you, too,
on top of everything else.


00:13:54.200 --> 00:13:57.700
So... I'll do whatever it takes to win!


00:13:57.700 --> 00:13:59.910
Whatever it takes to live!


00:14:16.790 --> 00:14:18.540
What just happened?!


00:14:33.660 --> 00:14:35.160
A Titan...


00:14:36.160 --> 00:14:37.700
...is killing...


00:14:39.660 --> 00:14:41.370
...another Titan...


00:14:51.330 --> 00:14:54.500
I was completely confused.


00:14:54.500 --> 00:14:57.950
But I also felt a faint glimmer of elation.


00:14:57.950 --> 00:15:00.290
Because what I saw...


00:15:00.290 --> 00:15:04.160
...looked like the manifestation
of humankind's anger.


00:15:18.750 --> 00:15:20.000
Misaka!


00:15:58.950 --> 00:16:00.750
Damn it!


00:16:03.950 --> 00:16:05.700
Damn it!


00:16:10.370 --> 00:16:14.660
Damn it! Damn it! Damn it!


00:16:14.660 --> 00:16:17.410
I refuse to give up!


00:16:17.410 --> 00:16:21.580
I'll drive them all out! Every last one!


00:16:22.700 --> 00:16:26.290
By my own hand!


00:16:30.660 --> 00:16:33.750
I'll drive you out of this world...


00:16:35.370 --> 00:16:39.370
More... I'm going to...


00:16:39.370 --> 00:16:41.410
...kill more of you...


00:16:43.700 --> 00:16:45.580
Eren?


00:16:53.870 --> 00:16:59.040
Before I knew it, I was surrounded
by soldiers I thought were comrades.


00:16:59.040 --> 00:17:02.830
It felt as if they were looking at a monster...


00:17:02.830 --> 00:17:06.250
...while brandishing weapons
made to kill Titans.


00:17:06.250 --> 00:17:08.660
I can't remember how I got here,


00:17:08.660 --> 00:17:12.870
but no matter what,
I refuse for this to be how I die!


00:17:14.750 --> 00:17:16.290
Eren! Armin!


00:17:16.290 --> 00:17:17.580
Head up the wall!


00:17:21.580 --> 00:17:22.870
Eren.


00:17:24.160 --> 00:17:29.660
When I get back, I'll show you the basement
that I've kept secret all this time.


00:17:29.660 --> 00:17:34.160
Keep this key on you at all times.


00:17:34.160 --> 00:17:38.200
And every time you see it, remember.


00:17:38.200 --> 00:17:41.660
Remember that you <i>must </i>visit that basement!


00:17:43.700 --> 00:17:46.910
You'll understand the truth someday
if you visit the basement!


00:17:46.910 --> 00:17:49.620
It will be a harsh, painful journey...


00:17:49.620 --> 00:17:52.250
...but you <i>must </i>reach it!


00:17:56.500 --> 00:18:00.700
If you want to save Mikasa,
Armin, and everyone else...


00:18:00.700 --> 00:18:05.450
...you must learn to control this ability!


00:18:14.330 --> 00:18:19.500
Using his Titan powers,
Eren protected Mikasa and me.


00:18:19.500 --> 00:18:22.660
As the situation took a turn for the worse,


00:18:22.660 --> 00:18:27.500
he had faith in me and
entrusted everything to me.


00:18:27.500 --> 00:18:30.330
"Eren isn't an enemy of humanity."


00:18:30.330 --> 00:18:34.410
Using those words, I so proclaimed, but...


00:18:35.410 --> 00:18:37.290
That's enough.


00:18:38.250 --> 00:18:43.290
I see you're still as delicate as
a young deer, despite your size.


00:18:45.080 --> 00:18:47.540
But the one who saved us


00:18:47.540 --> 00:18:53.290
was the top officer in charge of the entire
southern territory, Commander Pyxis.


00:18:53.290 --> 00:18:59.040
He listened to my idea and
immediately put a plan into motion.


00:18:59.040 --> 00:19:02.660
Attention!


00:19:02.660 --> 00:19:07.950
I will now explain to you the details
of the Trost Recovery Operation!


00:19:07.950 --> 00:19:14.330
He is the successful result of our top-secret
Titan transformation experiments!


00:19:14.330 --> 00:19:19.250
In Titan form, he will lift that
giant rock near the front gate,


00:19:19.250 --> 00:19:23.120
carry it to the wrecked gate, and seal the hole!


00:19:23.120 --> 00:19:24.870
As for <i>you</i>,


00:19:24.870 --> 00:19:30.790
you're to defend him from the other
Titans while he carries the rock!


00:19:30.790 --> 00:19:33.410
Should this operation succeed,


00:19:33.410 --> 00:19:39.830
humanity will have taken back land
from the Titans for the very first time!


00:19:39.830 --> 00:19:43.580
For humankind, that single, small step...


00:19:43.580 --> 00:19:46.080
...will be a great leap forward!


00:20:04.200 --> 00:20:06.750
Eren! Don't you recognize me?!


00:20:06.750 --> 00:20:11.080
I'm Mikasa! Part of your family!


00:20:11.080 --> 00:20:12.950
Dodge, Ackermann!


00:20:16.290 --> 00:20:17.830
What the hell?!


00:20:17.830 --> 00:20:20.790
He's just a regular, dumb Titan!


00:20:20.790 --> 00:20:22.290
Change of plans!


00:20:22.290 --> 00:20:26.370
We're to defend Jaeger from the other
Titans until we can recover him!


00:20:26.370 --> 00:20:29.410
He holds a precious chance for humanity.


00:20:31.040 --> 00:20:32.540
Where am I?


00:20:36.290 --> 00:20:38.080
I'm home...


00:20:38.080 --> 00:20:39.620
Mikasa!


00:20:39.620 --> 00:20:41.000
What happened to the plan?!


00:20:41.000 --> 00:20:42.410
It's failed!


00:20:42.410 --> 00:20:45.830
We're fighting because we
can't leave Eren behind!


00:20:45.830 --> 00:20:48.160
But there are too many Titans...


00:20:48.160 --> 00:20:50.910
At this rate, we'll be wiped out!


00:20:53.870 --> 00:20:56.120
From the back of the head
to the nape of the neck...


00:20:56.120 --> 00:20:59.830
...one meter high and ten centimeters across!


00:21:01.870 --> 00:21:05.000
Eren... Answer me...


00:21:05.000 --> 00:21:10.330
Even though just one step outside
the wall lies a hellish world...


00:21:10.330 --> 00:21:15.250
Why did you want to venture
into the outside world?!


00:21:17.500 --> 00:21:20.330
Why?


00:21:20.330 --> 00:21:21.660
Because...


00:21:21.660 --> 00:21:24.000
...I was born in this world!


00:21:32.870 --> 00:21:34.330
Eren!


00:21:37.500 --> 00:21:40.370
We can't go on, Captain!


00:21:40.370 --> 00:21:43.120
It's just us now!


00:22:03.660 --> 00:22:07.250
We gotta give Eren backup! Keep 'em off him!


00:22:10.580 --> 00:22:11.540
This way!


00:22:11.540 --> 00:22:13.160
Come get me!


00:22:19.410 --> 00:22:24.290
Why did you want to venture
into the outside world?


00:22:27.080 --> 00:22:32.120
From the moment we're born, we're all...


00:22:32.120 --> 00:22:33.830
...free...


00:22:35.950 --> 00:22:41.620
Some might try to deny that, but it
doesn't matter how strong they are!


00:22:42.870 --> 00:22:48.580
Fiery waters... Lands of ice...
Or whatever else!


00:22:48.580 --> 00:22:51.040
Whoever gets to see those things...


00:22:51.040 --> 00:22:55.290
...will have the greatest freedom
this world has to offer!


00:22:56.870 --> 00:22:58.910
Fight!


00:22:58.910 --> 00:23:02.080
If anything is worth giving
your life, it's that!


00:23:03.870 --> 00:23:08.250
It doesn't matter how terrifying
the world may be!


00:23:10.410 --> 00:23:14.790
It doesn't matter how cruel the world may be!


00:23:17.910 --> 00:23:22.000
Fight! Fight!


00:23:22.000 --> 00:23:23.700
Fight!


00:23:31.370 --> 00:23:34.750
Go, Eren!


00:23:55.250 --> 00:23:56.910
Everyone...


00:23:56.910 --> 00:24:00.700
Your deaths <i>weren't </i>in vain...


00:24:06.040 --> 00:24:09.870
Today, for the first time in history...


00:24:09.870 --> 00:24:12.410
...humanity has beaten the Titans!


00:24:14.660 --> 00:24:21.500
207 people were dead or missing,
and 897 were injured.


00:24:21.500 --> 00:24:25.950
Although this was the first time humanity
had stopped a Titan invasion,


00:24:25.950 --> 00:24:31.910
far too many people had been lost
to celebrate this historic achievement.


00:24:35.080 --> 00:24:37.120
Are you...


00:24:37.120 --> 00:24:40.290
...Marco?


00:24:40.290 --> 00:24:42.290
I'm sorry...


00:24:43.950 --> 00:24:46.500
I'm sorry...


00:24:46.500 --> 00:24:51.040
It's no use apologizing.
We need to hurry and give them a funeral.


00:25:02.830 --> 00:25:09.120
Commander Erwin, the head of
the Scouts Regiment's Task Force...


00:25:09.120 --> 00:25:11.120
...and Captain Levi!


00:25:13.200 --> 00:25:18.290
Dr. Jaeger's basement,
in your home in Shiganshina...


00:25:18.290 --> 00:25:21.950
A secret surrounding the
Titans is there, correct?


00:25:21.950 --> 00:25:24.290
Yes. I think so.


00:25:24.290 --> 00:25:27.540
That's what my father said.


00:25:27.540 --> 00:25:30.000
If we want to check out your home,


00:25:30.000 --> 00:25:34.040
we'll need to take back Shiganshina
District along Wall Maria.


00:25:35.000 --> 00:25:40.500
Sealing the damaged gate there
would be the best way to accomplish that.


00:25:40.500 --> 00:25:43.660
Which means we'll need your Titan ability.


00:25:44.950 --> 00:25:47.580
Your intentions are the key.


00:25:47.580 --> 00:25:51.790
The key to saving humankind from this despair.


00:25:54.450 --> 00:25:56.120
I'm...


00:26:00.160 --> 00:26:02.500
I'm going to drive out...


00:26:02.500 --> 00:26:07.120
...every last one from this world!


00:26:07.120 --> 00:26:10.700
Hey. Answer the damn question, you twit.


00:26:10.700 --> 00:26:13.290
What do you want to do?


00:26:17.540 --> 00:26:20.500
I want to join the Scouts...


00:26:20.500 --> 00:26:23.620
...and slaughter every Titan I can!


00:26:25.450 --> 00:26:29.330
Ah. Not bad.


00:26:29.330 --> 00:26:33.540
Erwin. I'll take responsibility for him.


00:26:33.540 --> 00:26:36.040
Let the higher-ups know.


00:26:36.040 --> 00:26:39.160
I don't necessarily trust him, though.


00:26:39.160 --> 00:26:44.200
If he betrays us or goes out of control,
I'll kill him on the spot.


00:26:44.200 --> 00:26:46.080
You're in.


00:26:46.080 --> 00:26:49.080
I'll make you a member of the Scouts.


00:26:51.000 --> 00:26:55.540
The Scout Regiment's Special
Operations Squad... aka Levi Squad.


00:26:55.540 --> 00:27:01.040
They're the Scout's best of the best--
elites chosen by Levi himself.


00:27:01.040 --> 00:27:05.580
With them, I prepared for the
expedition outside the walls.


00:27:05.580 --> 00:27:08.910
But around then, an incident occurred.


00:27:12.290 --> 00:27:15.330
Sawney! Beane!


00:27:15.330 --> 00:27:19.830
No... Tell me this isn't happening!


00:27:21.330 --> 00:27:23.580
They were such valuable test subjects...


00:27:23.580 --> 00:27:25.040
Did soldiers do this?


00:27:25.040 --> 00:27:28.580
Yeah. They haven't found who's responsible.


00:27:28.580 --> 00:27:33.910
The Titans that Section Commander Hange
captured alive for research


00:27:33.910 --> 00:27:37.200
had been killed by someone.


00:27:37.200 --> 00:27:39.410
What do <i>you </i>see here?


00:27:41.580 --> 00:27:44.120
What do you think the enemy is?


00:27:44.120 --> 00:27:45.580
Huh?


00:27:48.080 --> 00:27:51.370
Sorry. That was a strange thing to ask.


00:27:54.910 --> 00:28:00.250
The investigation that followed failed
to identify who killed the Titans.


00:28:00.250 --> 00:28:05.580
But after Mikasa, Armin, and our
classmates decided their regiments,


00:28:05.580 --> 00:28:07.540
the day was upon us.


00:28:09.410 --> 00:28:13.660
Now commencing the 57th
Exterior Scouting Mission!


00:28:13.660 --> 00:28:16.000
Move out!


00:28:18.000 --> 00:28:19.200
Mr. Oruo!


00:28:19.200 --> 00:28:23.290
Do you think they--my classmates--
can beat the Titans in a fight?


00:28:23.290 --> 00:28:28.750
Huh? What the hell did you just
spend this last month doing?!


00:28:28.750 --> 00:28:30.750
Listen, kid!


00:28:30.750 --> 00:28:35.950
Outside scouting missions are about
fighting Titans as little as possi--


00:28:39.540 --> 00:28:43.330
Assume long-range scouting formation!


00:28:43.330 --> 00:28:50.540
The expedition was meant to pave a route
to Shiganshina and Eren's house.


00:28:50.540 --> 00:28:57.870
However, it had a second objective,
which Erwin kept secret to all but a few.


00:28:57.870 --> 00:29:04.540
The arrival of a single Titan
caused a rapid turn of events.


00:29:04.540 --> 00:29:05.870
Armin!


00:29:08.620 --> 00:29:13.500
This one's <i>way </i>more athletic
than the other ones!


00:29:13.500 --> 00:29:14.750
I'm dead!


00:29:14.750 --> 00:29:18.870
Jean! Avenge that suicidal maniac!


00:29:21.040 --> 00:29:23.120
She stopped?


00:29:23.120 --> 00:29:25.950
It was her! She killed him!


00:29:25.950 --> 00:29:28.750
He got himself killed in the right wing!


00:29:28.750 --> 00:29:31.290
Avenge that suicidal maniac!


00:29:31.290 --> 00:29:32.540
Reiner...


00:30:02.500 --> 00:30:04.500
Draw your swords.


00:30:08.080 --> 00:30:12.700
If it shows itself, we'll only have a moment.


00:30:20.910 --> 00:30:22.750
You're not going anywhere!


00:30:31.290 --> 00:30:33.540
Eren! Focus ahead and keep moving!


00:30:33.540 --> 00:30:36.500
Are you saying to run away and abandon them?!


00:30:36.500 --> 00:30:37.910
Yes! I am!


00:30:37.910 --> 00:30:40.410
I don't understand why we're letting them die!


00:30:40.410 --> 00:30:43.700
The captain decided you don't need to know!


00:30:43.700 --> 00:30:47.080
Why should I always have to rely on others?


00:30:47.080 --> 00:30:48.910
I can just fight on my own!


00:30:48.910 --> 00:30:51.620
What are you doing, Eren?!


00:30:51.620 --> 00:30:55.250
You're <i>only </i>permitted to do that
when your life is in danger!


00:30:55.250 --> 00:30:57.790
That was our agreement, remember?!


00:30:59.500 --> 00:31:01.540
Eren!


00:31:01.540 --> 00:31:03.790
You're not in the wrong.


00:31:05.700 --> 00:31:07.620
If you wanna do it, do it.


00:31:10.290 --> 00:31:12.000
I can tell.


00:31:12.000 --> 00:31:18.450
He's a real monster, and not
because of his Titan ability.


00:31:18.450 --> 00:31:20.200
Choose.


00:31:20.200 --> 00:31:26.500
Will you trust yourself, or me, these guys,
and the entire Scout Regiment?


00:31:28.000 --> 00:31:31.790
I don't know the right choice. I never have.


00:31:31.790 --> 00:31:37.620
Whether I trusted myself or the choices
of my dependable comrades,


00:31:37.620 --> 00:31:40.620
there was no telling how things would turn out.


00:31:40.620 --> 00:31:47.290
So, just do the best you can...
and choose whichever you'll regret the least.


00:31:49.540 --> 00:31:51.290
I'll go with you!


00:31:54.040 --> 00:31:55.950
Let go!


00:32:01.700 --> 00:32:03.250
I'm sorry!


00:32:03.250 --> 00:32:06.120
Keep moving! We need to outrun it!


00:32:14.250 --> 00:32:16.580
Fire!


00:32:27.540 --> 00:32:33.160
The true goal of Erwin's plan was
to capture an Intelligent Titan...


00:32:33.160 --> 00:32:36.580
...using Eren to draw them out.


00:32:36.580 --> 00:32:43.080
With their capture, he hoped to
reveal the secrets of the Titans.


00:32:43.080 --> 00:32:44.700
However...


00:32:59.450 --> 00:33:06.120
This goes to show... that the enemy
was prepared to throw away everything.


00:33:06.120 --> 00:33:09.540
I never imagined our target would
resort to Titan cannibalization


00:33:09.540 --> 00:33:11.910
to dispose of information...


00:33:16.040 --> 00:33:18.370
Captain Levi?


00:33:18.370 --> 00:33:20.160
No... It's not!


00:33:20.160 --> 00:33:21.250
Who are you?!


00:33:30.580 --> 00:33:32.200
Mr. Gunther!


00:33:32.200 --> 00:33:34.290
Eren! Don't stop!


00:33:34.290 --> 00:33:35.450
Keep moving!


00:33:35.450 --> 00:33:37.200
But Mr. Gunther is--!


00:33:38.120 --> 00:33:39.040
Who's that?!


00:33:39.040 --> 00:33:41.080
Protect Eren!


00:33:41.080 --> 00:33:42.830
Is it the Female's operator?!


00:33:42.830 --> 00:33:46.200
You're going down, even if I have to die, too!


00:33:48.370 --> 00:33:54.000
If the enemy can remain able-bodied...


00:33:54.000 --> 00:33:58.040
...it's possible it can make
the Titan reappear, too.


00:34:09.790 --> 00:34:11.750
Damn... How could you?!


00:34:11.750 --> 00:34:14.160
This time I <i>will </i>kill her myself!


00:34:14.160 --> 00:34:16.160
No!


00:34:16.160 --> 00:34:18.910
The three of us will take her down!


00:34:18.910 --> 00:34:22.250
You just keep heading for HQ as fast as you can!


00:34:35.370 --> 00:34:36.660
We've blinded her!


00:34:36.660 --> 00:34:39.830
She should be in complete darkness
for at least a minute!


00:34:44.910 --> 00:34:46.080
We're going to carve you up...


00:34:46.080 --> 00:34:47.290
...and lop your arms...


00:34:47.290 --> 00:34:48.540
...off!


00:34:52.080 --> 00:34:53.330
They're down!


00:34:54.370 --> 00:34:56.040
Next is the neck!


00:35:00.080 --> 00:35:01.620
Eld!


00:35:08.250 --> 00:35:09.660
Only one eye?!


00:35:09.660 --> 00:35:12.160
She healed just one eye quicker?!


00:35:12.160 --> 00:35:14.870
Petra! Hurry!


00:35:19.410 --> 00:35:21.040
You're dead!


00:35:23.330 --> 00:35:27.700
What? Why didn't my blades penetrate it?


00:35:32.790 --> 00:35:34.500
I'm going to...


00:35:35.410 --> 00:35:37.450
I'm going to...


00:35:39.410 --> 00:35:41.000
...kill her!


00:35:52.750 --> 00:35:55.500
That roar... Don't tell me it's...!


00:35:56.620 --> 00:35:59.660
I made the wrong choice...


00:35:59.660 --> 00:36:03.080
...because I wanted to trust my teammates!


00:36:03.080 --> 00:36:06.700
If only I believed in myself
and fought from the start...!


00:36:06.700 --> 00:36:10.040
If only I had killed her from the very start...


00:36:10.040 --> 00:36:13.580
...then everyone might still be alive!


00:36:15.080 --> 00:36:19.000
With the failure of the 57th
Exterior Scouting Mission,


00:36:19.000 --> 00:36:23.660
Erwin and the others in charge
were summoned to the capital...


00:36:23.660 --> 00:36:27.250
...and were ordered to hand over Eren.


00:36:29.370 --> 00:36:32.580
We believe we've found who the Female Titan is.


00:36:32.580 --> 00:36:35.910
We <i>will </i>capture her this time.


00:36:35.910 --> 00:36:38.080
We do it the day after tomorrow,


00:36:38.080 --> 00:36:43.370
while passing through Stohess District
on our way to the capital.


00:36:43.370 --> 00:36:45.620
The target is a member of the Military Police.


00:36:45.620 --> 00:36:47.330
The Military Police?


00:36:47.330 --> 00:36:52.160
She might have trained with you
in the 104th Cadet Corps.


00:36:52.160 --> 00:36:55.500
The name of the girl we believe
to be the Female Titan...


00:36:55.500 --> 00:36:57.870
Y-You can't be serious...


00:37:09.620 --> 00:37:12.830
...is Annie Leonhart.


00:37:17.250 --> 00:37:18.620
Eren!


00:37:19.790 --> 00:37:21.000
Eren!


00:37:21.000 --> 00:37:24.250
It was Armin who identified her.


00:37:24.250 --> 00:37:28.370
The Female Titan knew what
you looked like from the start.


00:37:28.370 --> 00:37:32.160
Plus, she reacted to your nickname
of "suicidal maniac,"


00:37:32.160 --> 00:37:35.290
something only our classmates would know.


00:37:35.290 --> 00:37:36.750
The biggest reason, though,


00:37:36.750 --> 00:37:41.700
is that I believe <i>she </i>killed the
test subjects Sawney and Beane.


00:37:43.000 --> 00:37:47.120
Killing them would've required real skill,


00:37:47.120 --> 00:37:50.870
so she would've used the ODM gear
she'd become accustomed to.


00:37:50.870 --> 00:37:54.410
Yeah, but they held that equipment inspection.


00:37:54.410 --> 00:37:56.290
Annie's was fine.


00:37:56.290 --> 00:38:00.950
Because she presented Marco's gear.


00:38:00.950 --> 00:38:01.910
Eren.


00:38:01.910 --> 00:38:05.700
Does this talk about Annie ring any bells?


00:38:12.250 --> 00:38:14.080
You know, don't you?


00:38:15.290 --> 00:38:19.790
You know the Female Titan is Annie.


00:38:19.790 --> 00:38:21.290
I know.


00:38:21.290 --> 00:38:23.080
I failed before...


00:38:23.080 --> 00:38:27.790
...when I clung to my friends
and the bond we shared...


00:38:29.370 --> 00:38:31.120
Think back...


00:38:41.370 --> 00:38:44.750
I'm going... to wipe them out...!


00:38:44.750 --> 00:38:46.370
No...


00:38:46.370 --> 00:38:48.160
Slaughter them!


00:38:52.040 --> 00:38:56.120
There's no time to think
whether it's right or wrong!


00:38:56.120 --> 00:38:58.080
Just act!


00:38:58.080 --> 00:39:01.290
Don't try to end things all nice and neat!


00:39:01.290 --> 00:39:02.950
Yes...


00:39:02.950 --> 00:39:04.700
Mikasa!


00:39:04.700 --> 00:39:07.540
We live in a cruel world!


00:39:29.620 --> 00:39:30.950
Eren!


00:39:32.120 --> 00:39:33.790
Eren...


00:39:33.790 --> 00:39:35.250
Annie...


00:39:35.250 --> 00:39:41.290
You always acted like everything bored you.


00:39:42.250 --> 00:39:46.330
The only time you ever seemed full of life...


00:39:46.330 --> 00:39:49.870
...was when you showed off your fighting moves!


00:40:06.080 --> 00:40:07.330
Whoa...


00:40:17.620 --> 00:40:19.080
Annie...


00:40:20.410 --> 00:40:24.450
All I ask of you... is one thing...


00:40:27.370 --> 00:40:31.000
Even if you turn the whole world
against you, it's okay.


00:40:36.830 --> 00:40:39.250
So promise me...


00:40:40.450 --> 00:40:42.790
...that you'll come back...


00:40:58.700 --> 00:41:01.200
Huh? What's he doing?


00:41:04.330 --> 00:41:06.080
They're merging?!


00:41:10.750 --> 00:41:15.290
Don't go eatin' our key evidence, you idiot...


00:41:16.580 --> 00:41:19.330
Annie was crying.


00:41:19.330 --> 00:41:24.410
After seeing her like that,
I completely froze up.


00:41:26.250 --> 00:41:29.870
Seems the plan wasn't much of a success.


00:41:29.870 --> 00:41:37.620
No, I'd say the Scout Regiment's
in the clear now. Just barely.


00:41:39.580 --> 00:41:41.620
Let's hope so...


00:41:50.120 --> 00:41:52.450
H-Hey, is that...


00:41:52.450 --> 00:41:53.790
...a Titan?!


00:41:53.790 --> 00:41:56.080
What's that in the wall?


00:41:56.080 --> 00:41:57.450
It can't be!


00:41:59.450 --> 00:42:03.080
Was that there just by coincidence?


00:42:03.080 --> 00:42:07.000
Or does this mean...?!


00:42:11.700 --> 00:42:13.370
Pastor Nick?


00:42:13.370 --> 00:42:16.370
Whatever you do...


00:42:16.370 --> 00:42:20.700
Do <i>not </i>let the sunlight touch that Titan!


00:42:22.620 --> 00:42:29.410
From then on, things unheard of
began to happen, one after another.


00:42:29.410 --> 00:42:33.080
Tell me, what is that weapon called?


00:42:35.200 --> 00:42:38.870
That thing on your waist that flies around.


00:42:38.870 --> 00:42:41.620
Wel... come... home...


00:42:45.500 --> 00:42:48.500
Did you follow the wall here, too?


00:42:48.500 --> 00:42:49.580
Yeah.


00:42:49.580 --> 00:42:51.450
Where did you find the hole?


00:42:51.450 --> 00:42:52.870
Huh?


00:42:53.870 --> 00:42:56.910
Despite no reports of holes in the wall,


00:42:56.910 --> 00:43:01.660
Titans appeared out of nowhere
in increasing numbers.


00:43:02.830 --> 00:43:08.330
Meanwhile, Pastor Nick of the Order
of the Walls broke his silence


00:43:08.330 --> 00:43:12.870
about the walls' secrets
he swore to take to the grave.


00:43:12.870 --> 00:43:20.290
I can tell you the name of one whom
the sacred will instructed us to monitor.


00:43:20.290 --> 00:43:21.790
Monitor?


00:43:23.370 --> 00:43:28.200
That person has joined the Scout
Regiment as of this year.


00:43:30.450 --> 00:43:33.080
Their name is...


00:43:33.080 --> 00:43:34.450
Quit it, Christa!


00:43:34.450 --> 00:43:36.290
The tower's about to crumble!


00:43:36.290 --> 00:43:37.410
You'll fall!


00:43:37.410 --> 00:43:40.450
But they're dying in our place!


00:43:40.450 --> 00:43:41.120
--Nanaba...


00:43:41.120 --> 00:43:41.910
--No! No!
--Nanaba...


00:43:41.910 --> 00:43:42.870
--No! No!
--And Gelgar...


00:43:42.870 --> 00:43:44.620
Father, stop!


00:43:44.620 --> 00:43:45.750
Father!


00:43:45.750 --> 00:43:48.450
I'm sorry! No, don't!


00:43:48.450 --> 00:43:51.410
Father! No!


00:43:51.410 --> 00:43:54.000
She's the smallest one of us.


00:43:54.000 --> 00:43:56.250
She's got long golden hair.


00:43:56.250 --> 00:43:59.410
Um, and...


00:43:59.410 --> 00:44:00.330
She's cute.


00:44:00.330 --> 00:44:02.750
She's always hanging around Ymir.


00:44:02.750 --> 00:44:05.290
Huh? Ymir?


00:44:05.290 --> 00:44:06.580
Here.


00:44:09.080 --> 00:44:10.410
Thanks.


00:44:10.410 --> 00:44:12.700
What do you want it for?


00:44:12.700 --> 00:44:14.000
Hmm?


00:44:15.250 --> 00:44:17.870
I'm going to fight with this.


00:44:17.870 --> 00:44:19.410
Ymir...


00:44:20.500 --> 00:44:22.290
Christa.


00:44:22.290 --> 00:44:27.370
I have no right to tell you
how to live your life.


00:44:27.370 --> 00:44:32.120
So actually, this is nothing more
than a hope of mine...


00:44:33.500 --> 00:44:37.330
I want you... to live a life you're proud of.


00:44:41.080 --> 00:44:43.370
Ymir! Wait!


00:44:47.120 --> 00:44:48.830
Ymir!


00:45:08.540 --> 00:45:13.540
Attacked by Titans at Utgard Castle,
Christa and the others were saved...


00:45:13.540 --> 00:45:19.750
...by someone who could turn into a Titan
like Eren--a comrade from the 104th.


00:45:22.290 --> 00:45:24.000
It can't be...


00:45:24.000 --> 00:45:26.410
Ymir is...


00:45:26.410 --> 00:45:28.080
Ymir...


00:45:37.500 --> 00:45:39.580
My real name...


00:45:40.580 --> 00:45:43.200
...is Historia.


00:45:46.040 --> 00:45:51.580
And once again, there was
a drastic turn of events.


00:45:53.160 --> 00:45:54.250
Annie's?


00:45:54.250 --> 00:45:55.250
Yeah.


00:45:55.250 --> 00:46:01.580
There were two others belonging to the 104th
Cadet Corps who came from the same area as her.


00:46:02.540 --> 00:46:06.660
Reiner Braun... and Bertholdt Hoover.


00:46:11.290 --> 00:46:15.370
As their comrade,
I'd find it hard to believe.


00:46:15.370 --> 00:46:17.660
Set aside Bertholdt, who doesn't say much.


00:46:17.660 --> 00:46:23.160
Reiner is like everyone's big brother, and he's
not devious enough to deceive all of us.


00:46:24.080 --> 00:46:26.290
I agree.


00:46:26.290 --> 00:46:30.160
Reiner gave everything he had
fighting the Female Titan with me.


00:46:30.160 --> 00:46:34.040
He would have gotten crushed
in her hand if he hadn't--


00:46:35.080 --> 00:46:37.370
What's wrong?


00:46:37.370 --> 00:46:40.540
Reiner managed to escape, but...


00:46:40.540 --> 00:46:43.290
...Annie suddenly changed her course...


00:46:43.290 --> 00:46:47.040
...and ran in the direction of Eren.


00:46:47.040 --> 00:46:51.120
When that happened, the Female Titan
was staring into her palm.


00:46:51.120 --> 00:46:55.080
He might have written a message
with his blades in her hand.


00:46:56.250 --> 00:46:57.950
Reiner could've...


00:47:02.450 --> 00:47:03.830
Eren.


00:47:03.830 --> 00:47:05.200
Have a minute?


00:47:05.200 --> 00:47:07.870
We need to talk.


00:47:07.870 --> 00:47:09.330
What about?


00:47:10.500 --> 00:47:15.700
Five years ago, we demolished the wall
and began our attack on humanity.


00:47:15.700 --> 00:47:20.200
Oh, no... What if there's a Titan
that dug a hole underneath the wall?


00:47:20.200 --> 00:47:23.080
The hole will be hard to find in that case.


00:47:23.080 --> 00:47:26.540
I'm the Armored Titan
and he's the Colossal Titan.


00:47:26.540 --> 00:47:30.580
Right now, we need to focus
on getting Ymir back safely.


00:47:30.580 --> 00:47:34.500
Even with horses, we still have
to worry about Titans.


00:47:34.500 --> 00:47:36.040
Huh?


00:47:36.040 --> 00:47:37.500
What are you talking about?


00:47:37.500 --> 00:47:39.750
Why are you telling him, Reiner?


00:47:39.750 --> 00:47:45.080
Our primary goal was to ensure
all of humanity was wiped out,


00:47:45.080 --> 00:47:49.040
but now there's no need for that.


00:47:49.040 --> 00:47:50.200
Eren.


00:47:50.200 --> 00:47:56.120
If you agree to come with us, we won't
have to destroy any more of the walls.


00:47:57.120 --> 00:47:58.370
You understand, right?


00:47:58.370 --> 00:47:59.830
Huh?


00:47:59.830 --> 00:48:02.660
Hey! We're leaving!


00:48:04.370 --> 00:48:07.660
You're just tired, aren't you?


00:48:07.660 --> 00:48:12.540
Besides, if you were really the Armored Titan
that wants to destroy humanity...


00:48:12.540 --> 00:48:16.620
...why would you be asking me
this in the first place?


00:48:16.620 --> 00:48:22.000
What did you think would happen?
That I'd nod and say "Sure, let's go"?


00:48:28.750 --> 00:48:31.000
Oh, right.


00:48:31.000 --> 00:48:33.580
That's right.


00:48:33.580 --> 00:48:36.040
What the hell was I thinking?


00:48:47.790 --> 00:48:52.700
It's too late now... I don't know
what's right anymore.


00:48:52.700 --> 00:48:55.910
But the only choice for me now...


00:48:55.910 --> 00:48:59.080
...is to face the consequences of my actions...


00:49:00.540 --> 00:49:02.870
...and as a warrior...


00:49:02.870 --> 00:49:06.120
...fulfill my duty to the bitter end!


00:49:08.910 --> 00:49:12.540
We settle this! Right here, right now!


00:49:21.790 --> 00:49:24.540
Eren! Run!


00:49:29.830 --> 00:49:32.830
Eren! Get out of there!


00:49:55.790 --> 00:49:57.870
Ymir!


00:49:58.790 --> 00:50:01.790
I'm going to return to the hometown we lost.


00:50:01.790 --> 00:50:05.290
That's all I care about now.


00:50:06.790 --> 00:50:08.500
Bertholdt...


00:50:08.500 --> 00:50:10.330
Reiner...


00:50:14.410 --> 00:50:20.000
You damn traitors!


00:50:42.750 --> 00:50:44.660
Mikasa?


00:50:44.660 --> 00:50:46.500
Armin! Where's Eren?!


00:50:46.500 --> 00:50:48.830
Mikasa, calm down!


00:50:48.830 --> 00:50:52.580
You shouldn't be moving!
We don't know how badly you're injured!


00:50:57.830 --> 00:51:00.160
Where is he?!


00:51:00.160 --> 00:51:02.660
Eren was taken away.


00:51:04.250 --> 00:51:07.370
Ymir, too, by Bertholdt and Reiner.


00:51:08.870 --> 00:51:14.330
Eren... He lost to the Armored Titan.


00:51:14.330 --> 00:51:17.200
It's been five hours since then.


00:51:19.410 --> 00:51:21.250
Is anyone...?


00:51:21.250 --> 00:51:23.700
Is anyone chasing them?


00:51:25.000 --> 00:51:26.500
No...


00:51:29.830 --> 00:51:33.200
Hey, Armin.


00:51:33.200 --> 00:51:35.040
Why?


00:51:35.040 --> 00:51:40.330
Why does Eren always go
somewhere far away from us?


00:51:40.330 --> 00:51:43.700
Yeah, now that you mention it...


00:51:43.700 --> 00:51:50.830
Eren has always run off on his own,
leaving us behind...


00:51:50.830 --> 00:51:57.160
I guess that's just the way things are
meant to happen... for Eren at least.


00:52:03.910 --> 00:52:08.410
But all I want... is to be at his side.


00:52:11.160 --> 00:52:14.660
Mikasa? So you're up, huh?


00:52:14.660 --> 00:52:16.200
I bet you're hungry.


00:52:16.200 --> 00:52:17.660
Here, eat this.


00:52:19.040 --> 00:52:20.700
Armin, catch.


00:52:22.500 --> 00:52:26.700
As usual, field rations are all there is.


00:52:30.620 --> 00:52:31.910
Hmm...


00:52:31.910 --> 00:52:36.250
Tastes neither good nor bad. Same as always.


00:52:41.250 --> 00:52:44.370
Speaking of which,
this is the same as always, too.


00:52:44.370 --> 00:52:50.660
Ever since the good old days, you two have
been there to clean up the mess of that brat.


00:52:50.660 --> 00:52:54.410
That's what I call a lousy relationship. Sheesh.


00:52:56.580 --> 00:53:00.500
I loved those good old days.


00:53:00.500 --> 00:53:07.160
If you asked Eren, he'd say those days
were nothing more than a false peace.


00:53:07.160 --> 00:53:12.700
But for me, I'm more than happy
to be a drunk, useless soldier.


00:53:13.750 --> 00:53:20.700
If it means getting back those plain,
ordinary days, I'll do whatever I have to.


00:53:20.700 --> 00:53:23.580
No matter how long it takes to get there.


00:53:24.660 --> 00:53:26.750
I'm coming, too.


00:53:26.750 --> 00:53:32.500
Without you three together again,
I can't bring back the good old days.


00:53:42.160 --> 00:53:45.370
For now, let's get to a place without Titans!


00:53:45.370 --> 00:53:48.290
We need to get as far away as possible!


00:53:48.290 --> 00:53:50.790
My Titan form isn't very fast.


00:53:50.790 --> 00:53:54.290
If I get surrounded, I won't
be able to protect you guys!


00:53:54.290 --> 00:53:58.200
Then why didn't we just wait until nightfall?!


00:53:58.200 --> 00:54:01.500
Smoke signals? Did the Scouts come to rescue us?


00:54:01.500 --> 00:54:03.450
It must be Commander Erwin.


00:54:03.450 --> 00:54:05.370
A tough opponent!


00:54:07.160 --> 00:54:10.040
Shit... They're already that close?


00:54:14.160 --> 00:54:15.750
A light?


00:54:15.750 --> 00:54:17.830
Soldiers, disperse!


00:54:17.830 --> 00:54:20.540
Locate Eren and recover him!


00:54:40.040 --> 00:54:42.250
Advance!


00:54:46.250 --> 00:54:50.250
Commander Erwin!


00:54:50.250 --> 00:54:54.330
Advance!


00:54:54.330 --> 00:54:56.500
Eren is just ahead!


00:54:56.500 --> 00:54:58.830
Advance!


00:55:27.870 --> 00:55:30.660
All soldiers, retreat!


00:55:42.660 --> 00:55:44.790
Eren! Mikasa!


00:56:07.950 --> 00:56:09.410
Eren!


00:56:14.290 --> 00:56:15.790
Hannes!


00:56:18.160 --> 00:56:19.500
You just watch.


00:56:19.500 --> 00:56:24.750
I'm about to avenge your mother
and butcher the shit out of this!


00:56:26.200 --> 00:56:27.830
Hannes!


00:56:31.620 --> 00:56:33.250
Christa!


00:56:33.250 --> 00:56:35.540
Conny, that's wrong.


00:56:35.540 --> 00:56:38.330
My name is Historia.


00:56:38.330 --> 00:56:39.540
Ymir...


00:56:39.540 --> 00:56:43.500
You're the one who said it,
so listen to yourself!


00:56:44.660 --> 00:56:47.290
Stop living for other people!


00:56:47.290 --> 00:56:51.500
From now on, let's live for
nobody but ourselves!


00:57:00.000 --> 00:57:01.540
What's wrong?!


00:57:05.290 --> 00:57:06.750
Eren!


00:57:26.370 --> 00:57:27.910
Right now...


00:57:27.910 --> 00:57:30.250
...I've gotta become a Titan...


00:57:32.870 --> 00:57:35.080
...or it's all for nothing!


00:58:13.500 --> 00:58:15.660
Eren...


00:58:15.660 --> 00:58:17.500
Nothing changed!


00:58:17.500 --> 00:58:21.250
You haven't changed one bit, dammit!


00:58:21.250 --> 00:58:24.750
You're still as useless as you ever were!


00:58:26.330 --> 00:58:29.080
Nothing changed!


00:58:29.080 --> 00:58:31.000
Mom...


00:58:31.000 --> 00:58:36.660
I still... can't do anything at all.


00:58:36.660 --> 00:58:38.120
Eren...


00:58:45.200 --> 00:58:47.370
That's not true.


00:58:48.290 --> 00:58:49.910
Eren...


00:58:51.120 --> 00:58:53.410
I need to tell you something.


00:58:57.950 --> 00:59:01.870
You've always... been at my side.


00:59:01.870 --> 00:59:03.540
Thank you.


00:59:07.450 --> 00:59:12.040
You showed me... how to live with purpose.


00:59:13.000 --> 00:59:14.790
Thank you.


00:59:20.250 --> 00:59:22.000
And you...


00:59:24.910 --> 00:59:27.330
You wrapped this scarf around me.


00:59:27.330 --> 00:59:29.120
Thank you.


00:59:39.580 --> 00:59:44.330
I'll wrap that around you...
as many times as you want.


00:59:46.330 --> 00:59:50.660
Now and forever... as much as you want!


01:00:32.370 --> 01:00:35.080
Dunno what's going on, but now's our chance!


01:00:35.080 --> 01:00:36.540
Let's hurry and run!


01:00:36.540 --> 01:00:37.790
Right!


01:00:37.790 --> 01:00:39.790
So that's how it is...


01:00:39.790 --> 01:00:43.500
That's why Reiner was so desperate for Eren.


01:00:43.500 --> 01:00:46.870
Which means, even inside the walls...


01:00:46.870 --> 01:00:48.790
...there's a future.


01:00:50.870 --> 01:00:53.080
This is the worst...


01:00:53.080 --> 01:00:58.330
Why did the Coordinate have to fall into
the hands of the worst person imaginable?


01:00:58.330 --> 01:01:00.790
We've gotta get it back...


01:01:00.790 --> 01:01:04.330
I can say... without a doubt...


01:01:04.330 --> 01:01:07.750
...the one person in the world
I wouldn't want to have it...


01:01:07.750 --> 01:01:11.370
...is you, Eren!


01:01:11.370 --> 01:01:13.910
Get away from me!


01:01:13.910 --> 01:01:17.330
You bastards! I'll kill you all!


01:01:21.290 --> 01:01:23.950
Not good! Bertholdt!


01:01:24.910 --> 01:01:26.080
Eren!


01:01:27.410 --> 01:01:28.200
Get on!


01:01:28.200 --> 01:01:30.250
Armin!


01:01:30.250 --> 01:01:32.000
Hurry!


01:01:32.000 --> 01:01:34.200
Don't let this chance escape!


01:01:34.200 --> 01:01:36.250
Full retreat!


01:01:39.000 --> 01:01:40.620
Ymir!


01:01:40.620 --> 01:01:44.410
Hey, ugly! What are you doing?!
We're heading back!


01:01:50.040 --> 01:01:52.620
I sorry...


01:01:53.540 --> 01:01:55.120
Huh?


01:01:59.830 --> 01:02:02.120
Ymir! Where are you going?!


01:02:02.120 --> 01:02:04.500
--Leave her!
--But Ymir is--


01:02:12.160 --> 01:02:18.500
In that moment, I couldn't understand
the motivation behind Ymir's actions...


01:02:18.500 --> 01:02:22.660
...but the Armored Titan
didn't pursue us any further.


01:02:39.120 --> 01:02:41.910
{\an8}"Trost District"


01:02:41.910 --> 01:02:43.160
{\an8}"Trost District"


01:02:41.910 --> 01:02:43.160
Say again?


01:02:44.620 --> 01:02:49.660
The Titans responsible for this incident...
were the citizens of Ragako?


01:02:51.580 --> 01:02:55.620
In other words, the true identity of Titans...


01:02:55.620 --> 01:02:58.000
...is humans?


01:03:00.750 --> 01:03:03.910
We don't... have proof yet.


01:03:12.250 --> 01:03:13.620
Erwin.


01:03:16.500 --> 01:03:20.040
Hey. Tell me.


01:03:20.040 --> 01:03:22.410
The hell you smiling for?


01:03:22.410 --> 01:03:28.040
Soon after, Pastor Nick, who revealed
Historia's identity, was murdered.


01:03:28.040 --> 01:03:32.160
The government put a freeze
on all Scout activity as well.


01:03:32.160 --> 01:03:34.540
And after apprehending Erwin,


01:03:34.540 --> 01:03:38.750
they ordered the Scouts to
hand over Eren and Historia.


01:03:38.750 --> 01:03:45.160
The plan to plug the wall with his Titan
powers was regrettably put on hold.


01:03:45.160 --> 01:03:46.120
Watch out!


01:03:46.120 --> 01:03:47.410
Behind us!


01:03:51.950 --> 01:03:53.660
A-Armi--


01:03:53.660 --> 01:03:56.080
I mean, Christa and Eren!


01:03:56.080 --> 01:03:58.910
They got snatched away again!


01:04:00.950 --> 01:04:03.580
Will it really work?


01:04:03.580 --> 01:04:07.370
He looks absolutely nothing like me...


01:04:07.370 --> 01:04:10.450
That horse face? Yeah right...


01:04:14.370 --> 01:04:19.080
Yeah? You like that? Let me hear you moan.


01:04:19.080 --> 01:04:23.370
Well? How's that? Doesn't it feel good?


01:04:23.370 --> 01:04:27.040
I'm just dying to hear your cute little voice.


01:04:32.700 --> 01:04:36.660
This is why I didn't wanna go
through this shit a second time!


01:04:36.660 --> 01:04:39.580
Screw being his body double!


01:04:39.580 --> 01:04:42.250
Hey! Get outta the way!


01:04:43.370 --> 01:04:45.370
Something is wrong...


01:04:45.370 --> 01:04:48.120
The Military Police can't be behind this.


01:04:48.120 --> 01:04:53.120
They're far too arrogant.
They wouldn't use amateurs.


01:04:53.120 --> 01:04:56.410
Nifa, have you heard about Kenny the Ripper?


01:04:56.410 --> 01:04:59.160
The mass-murderer in the capital?


01:04:59.160 --> 01:05:02.160
The one that slit the throats
of over 100 Military Police?


01:05:02.160 --> 01:05:06.120
That's just an urban legend
from years ago, right?


01:05:06.120 --> 01:05:08.950
He is real, and the stories are true.


01:05:08.950 --> 01:05:10.040
Huh?


01:05:10.040 --> 01:05:13.080
I lived with him for a while when I was a kid.


01:05:13.080 --> 01:05:15.790
What? Why would you even say that?


01:05:15.790 --> 01:05:18.120
This isn't the time to be making jokes.


01:05:19.830 --> 01:05:21.000
Nifa!


01:05:31.080 --> 01:05:33.660
Yo, Levi.


01:05:34.660 --> 01:05:37.080
You grown any yet?


01:05:44.000 --> 01:05:46.450
Kenny!


01:05:49.540 --> 01:05:51.040
Kaboom!


01:06:07.160 --> 01:06:08.450
Historia!


01:06:11.910 --> 01:06:13.000
Eren!


01:06:22.750 --> 01:06:26.790
Shit! They predicted every
last one of our movements!


01:06:49.790 --> 01:06:51.540
Oof!


01:06:51.540 --> 01:06:56.450
Shit... If this keeps up, I'll lose
my team, Eren, and Historia, too.


01:06:56.450 --> 01:06:57.290
Tsk!


01:06:57.290 --> 01:07:02.540
Ain't that the damnedest thing!
I smell a filthy rat coming from this bar...


01:07:02.540 --> 01:07:05.250
Come out, you little rodent...


01:07:05.250 --> 01:07:07.250
Found ya!


01:07:07.250 --> 01:07:10.040
The law has come to exterminate the vermin!


01:07:10.040 --> 01:07:12.910
Bang! Bang!


01:07:12.910 --> 01:07:14.250
Eek!


01:07:15.580 --> 01:07:18.700
The hell?! Ain't you here?!


01:07:18.700 --> 01:07:21.700
Right here, Kenny. It's been a while.


01:07:21.700 --> 01:07:24.870
Never thought you'd still be alive.


01:07:24.870 --> 01:07:28.000
I been looking forward to seeing you in action.


01:07:28.000 --> 01:07:33.330
Never thought all those tricks I taught you
would be helping you out like this.


01:07:35.910 --> 01:07:39.290
We had no choice but to survive
in that garbage dump.


01:07:39.290 --> 01:07:42.660
It took all we had each day to keep livin'.


01:07:42.660 --> 01:07:49.370
And when we found out how big the world
really was, you can bet it hurt like hell.


01:07:49.370 --> 01:07:52.330
But something saved us...


01:07:52.330 --> 01:07:56.750
We'd found something we
wanted to do. It's that simple.


01:07:56.750 --> 01:07:58.410
It's simple, but the truth is...


01:07:58.410 --> 01:08:02.500
The only thing that made our lives
fulfilling was finding hobbies.


01:08:02.500 --> 01:08:07.830
Hobbies? So is blowing the heads
off my team another hobby of yours?


01:08:07.830 --> 01:08:13.000
Yup... To achieve my grand goals,
I'll kill as much as I have to.


01:08:13.000 --> 01:08:16.500
You're no different.
You kill when it benefits you, too.


01:08:16.500 --> 01:08:17.750
Yeah...


01:08:21.750 --> 01:08:23.040
Wait!


01:08:23.040 --> 01:08:25.000
Captain...


01:08:25.000 --> 01:08:26.120
Gunshots!


01:08:26.120 --> 01:08:28.080
--Huh?
--From there!


01:08:29.040 --> 01:08:31.200
I heard a bunch of shots!


01:08:32.950 --> 01:08:34.910
You think something happened?


01:08:34.910 --> 01:08:37.330
Most likely.


01:08:37.330 --> 01:08:39.580
The Captain had this message for us...


01:08:39.580 --> 01:08:44.540
From now on, we'll be fighting
humans, too, and not just Titans.


01:08:47.830 --> 01:08:50.500
Please forgive me for everything.


01:08:50.500 --> 01:08:54.700
In order to protect you, I had no other choice.


01:08:54.700 --> 01:08:57.370
F-Father...


01:08:57.370 --> 01:09:01.660
You're special... Royal blood runs through you.


01:09:03.830 --> 01:09:06.370
It... does?


01:09:06.370 --> 01:09:10.290
Our Reiss family is the true royal line.


01:09:10.290 --> 01:09:15.790
And because you're special, you're the one
and only person who can save all of humanity.


01:09:15.790 --> 01:09:18.290
Now, let us go, Historia.


01:09:18.290 --> 01:09:21.910
To the place it all began...


01:09:21.910 --> 01:09:27.950
Having learned Reiss was the true
royal family, Erwin led a coup d'état.


01:09:27.950 --> 01:09:31.790
Together with Zachary,
the head of all regiments,


01:09:31.790 --> 01:09:35.290
he dismantled the government in power.


01:09:36.200 --> 01:09:42.200
As far as humanity's concerned, we should have
let the government do as they please.


01:09:42.200 --> 01:09:44.250
Like Commander Pyxis was saying,


01:09:44.250 --> 01:09:48.830
they've somehow devised a means
of keeping humanity alive until now.


01:09:48.830 --> 01:09:52.330
Should I have let Eren go,
risked my comrade's lives,


01:09:52.330 --> 01:09:58.250
given up both my life and my duty,
and entrusted it all to the government?


01:09:58.250 --> 01:10:02.330
If humanity is more precious
than one single life...


01:10:05.870 --> 01:10:09.200
Your duty is as painful as ever.


01:10:09.200 --> 01:10:12.450
Dying seems a far easier option.


01:10:13.830 --> 01:10:17.790
In that case, why didn't you do as you say?


01:10:19.330 --> 01:10:21.410
I...


01:10:21.410 --> 01:10:24.080
...have a dream.


01:10:24.080 --> 01:10:26.540
One I've had since I was a child...


01:10:32.080 --> 01:10:37.120
Before the night is over,
we'll have soldiers all over Reiss' land.


01:10:37.120 --> 01:10:41.450
Unfortunately, I doubt
he'll be waiting that long.


01:10:41.450 --> 01:10:47.000
If we don't hurry and get there,
Eren may end up being eaten.


01:10:47.000 --> 01:10:51.120
Eren overheard Ymir and Bertholdt talking...


01:10:51.120 --> 01:10:57.370
If a Titan eats a person who can change into
a Titan and thus inherits their powers...


01:10:57.370 --> 01:11:00.370
If that's actually true...


01:11:00.370 --> 01:11:07.580
When and how did Eren become a Titan,
and who did he eat to gain his powers?


01:11:07.580 --> 01:11:10.500
At one time, I had five children.


01:11:12.160 --> 01:11:16.660
But my wife, all of my children,
Frieda included,


01:11:16.660 --> 01:11:22.580
were killed five years ago
by his father, Grisha Jaeger.


01:11:29.200 --> 01:11:36.250
Five years ago, my dad was
superior to all other Titans.


01:11:36.250 --> 01:11:40.120
He ate Historia's sister and stole her power...


01:11:40.120 --> 01:11:44.080
...and then I... ate my dad.


01:11:46.830 --> 01:11:49.870
Dad?


01:11:58.870 --> 01:12:03.080
Now, that power resides within Eren.


01:12:03.080 --> 01:12:04.910
However, that power...


01:12:04.910 --> 01:12:10.750
It can't truly manifest unless the blood
of the Reiss family runs through them.


01:12:10.750 --> 01:12:15.120
As long as he remains a vessel for that power...


01:12:15.120 --> 01:12:18.200
...this hell will forever continue.


01:12:18.200 --> 01:12:20.000
Eh?


01:12:20.000 --> 01:12:21.830
Then...


01:12:21.830 --> 01:12:25.250
Hey, hey, hey, hey, hey, hey!


01:12:25.250 --> 01:12:27.080
Kenny.


01:12:27.080 --> 01:12:32.700
So unless it's a Reiss who eats Eren,
they can't become a true King?


01:12:32.700 --> 01:12:34.290
That is correct.


01:12:34.290 --> 01:12:40.750
Th-Then... Even if I turn into a Titan
and eat Eren, it'll mean nothin'?


01:12:40.750 --> 01:12:42.540
I see now...


01:12:42.540 --> 01:12:47.540
My Titan powers... It was pointless
for me to ever have them.


01:12:47.540 --> 01:12:53.160
It was my dad who started this hell
that's stolen so many lives.


01:12:53.160 --> 01:12:56.330
I can never atone for it all.


01:12:56.330 --> 01:12:58.200
It shouldn't have happened...


01:12:58.200 --> 01:13:00.450
Those days of training...


01:13:00.450 --> 01:13:03.250
That dream beyond the walls...


01:13:03.250 --> 01:13:07.000
I... shouldn't have happened.


01:13:08.000 --> 01:13:11.200
You both become Titans and have at it.


01:13:11.200 --> 01:13:14.870
If Historia wins, you'll have your peace.


01:13:14.870 --> 01:13:19.540
But if you lose to Eren,
the situation stays the same.


01:13:22.910 --> 01:13:26.450
Keep drawing breath till I run out and die?


01:13:26.450 --> 01:13:29.830
Can you even call that livin'?!


01:13:30.870 --> 01:13:32.540
Father...


01:13:34.370 --> 01:13:38.370
Why didn't the Reiss family...
in that whole 100 years...


01:13:38.370 --> 01:13:43.160
...eliminate the Titans and liberate humanity?


01:13:43.160 --> 01:13:47.620
All while possessing the power
to control all the Titans...


01:13:47.620 --> 01:13:53.200
Because, the first Reiss King who
built this world within the walls...


01:13:53.200 --> 01:13:57.660
...wished for us to be controlled by the Titans.


01:13:57.660 --> 01:14:03.000
The First King believed that was
the only path to true peace.


01:14:07.700 --> 01:14:09.290
Christa.


01:14:12.040 --> 01:14:15.580
I want you... to live a life you're proud of.


01:14:25.200 --> 01:14:27.580
Historia!


01:14:32.040 --> 01:14:37.580
God, my ass! You're just giving yourself
an out and manipulating other people!


01:14:37.580 --> 01:14:41.620
I've had it! I won't let you kill me!


01:14:45.370 --> 01:14:46.870
Father...


01:14:47.870 --> 01:14:49.500
Uri...


01:14:49.500 --> 01:14:51.330
Frieda...


01:14:51.330 --> 01:14:53.250
Wait for me...


01:14:53.250 --> 01:14:56.870
I'll... now...


01:15:06.910 --> 01:15:08.330
Historia!


01:15:09.750 --> 01:15:11.000
You okay?


01:15:11.000 --> 01:15:12.080
Mikasa!


01:15:12.080 --> 01:15:14.370
Captain? You guys...


01:15:18.000 --> 01:15:19.750
Conny, hurry!


01:15:19.750 --> 01:15:21.040
Forget about me!


01:15:21.040 --> 01:15:23.620
Captain! Hurry and escape!


01:15:25.790 --> 01:15:26.750
He's loose!


01:15:26.750 --> 01:15:27.950
Get back!


01:15:37.870 --> 01:15:40.750
I'm sorry, everyone...


01:15:44.790 --> 01:15:48.160
I've been nothing but useless...


01:15:48.160 --> 01:15:54.290
Ever since the very beginning,
I was never the hope of humanity...


01:15:58.290 --> 01:16:00.450
Armor?


01:16:00.450 --> 01:16:04.000
What's this? Think you're some tragic hero?


01:16:04.000 --> 01:16:08.250
When have you ever accomplished
anything by your strength alone?


01:16:08.250 --> 01:16:09.870
What a weakling.


01:16:09.870 --> 01:16:12.290
We've been through much worse than this.


01:16:12.290 --> 01:16:14.370
Not that I wanna get used to it!


01:16:14.370 --> 01:16:16.000
I'll take Eren.


01:16:16.000 --> 01:16:17.410
It's useless.


01:16:17.410 --> 01:16:19.080
We can't escape.


01:16:19.080 --> 01:16:20.580
So do nothing?


01:16:20.580 --> 01:16:24.160
You wanna sit here and hold hands
till we're crushed or burn to death?


01:16:24.160 --> 01:16:28.250
You know, I hate doing this
to you every time, but...


01:16:28.250 --> 01:16:30.450
Eren.


01:16:30.450 --> 01:16:32.910
You've gotta make the choice.


01:16:37.040 --> 01:16:38.910
I'll go with you!


01:16:46.250 --> 01:16:48.040
Eren!


01:16:48.040 --> 01:16:50.040
I'm sorry...


01:16:50.040 --> 01:16:52.620
Since it's the end, just this once...


01:16:52.620 --> 01:16:55.540
...I want you to let me...


01:16:55.540 --> 01:16:58.040
Let me believe in myself!


01:17:09.950 --> 01:17:12.660
Everyone! Get underneath Eren!


01:17:24.290 --> 01:17:26.700
Rod Reiss became a Titan,


01:17:26.700 --> 01:17:31.660
demolishing the chapel before
crawling towards Orvud District.


01:17:31.660 --> 01:17:38.580
Within the blast, Eren had succeeded
in hardening for the first time.


01:17:41.330 --> 01:17:42.700
Historia.


01:17:42.700 --> 01:17:44.790
Forgot to tell you...


01:17:44.790 --> 01:17:47.000
We need you to do something.


01:17:47.000 --> 01:17:48.330
Yes?


01:17:50.790 --> 01:17:53.000
Erwin's orders.


01:17:53.000 --> 01:17:57.620
When this battle is over, since you're
the true successor to the throne...


01:17:57.620 --> 01:17:59.290
...become the Queen.


01:17:59.290 --> 01:18:00.370
Eh?


01:18:00.370 --> 01:18:01.200
Huh?


01:18:01.200 --> 01:18:03.160
Q-Queen?!


01:18:03.160 --> 01:18:09.040
The coup d'état was successful, but the people
won't follow a regiment sitting at the top.


01:18:09.040 --> 01:18:11.410
What we need is a story to spread.


01:18:11.410 --> 01:18:16.500
That a true heir retook the crown from the fake.


01:18:16.500 --> 01:18:18.120
I...


01:18:20.790 --> 01:18:23.910
My next duty is to be Queen, right?


01:18:23.910 --> 01:18:26.200
Understood.


01:18:26.200 --> 01:18:28.290
Historia...


01:18:28.290 --> 01:18:31.910
Captain, I do have one condition.


01:18:31.910 --> 01:18:33.200
Hmm?


01:18:33.200 --> 01:18:37.910
Since my fate is my own,
I want to lay it all on the line.


01:18:37.910 --> 01:18:40.370
What the hell are you thinking, Erwin?!


01:18:40.370 --> 01:18:44.120
Keep the citizens in the city
without evacuating?!


01:18:44.120 --> 01:18:48.660
By the time it's dawn,
that Titan will be all over us!


01:18:48.660 --> 01:18:54.120
The target Titan is strangely attracted
to high concentrations of people.


01:18:54.120 --> 01:18:55.750
Hence, Abnormal.


01:18:55.750 --> 01:19:00.790
{\an8}"Capital Mitras"                "Orvud District"


01:18:55.750 --> 01:19:00.790
If right now, you were to evacuate
the citizens within Wall Sina,


01:19:00.790 --> 01:19:06.040
{\an8}"Capital Mitras"                "Orvud District"


01:19:00.790 --> 01:19:06.040
it would be drawn towards them,
destroying the wall and all in its path.


01:19:06.040 --> 01:19:11.330
If we are to stop that Titan, we must do so
outside the walls of Orvud District.


01:19:11.330 --> 01:19:14.830
Wall-mounted cannons should
prove highly effective, but...


01:19:14.830 --> 01:19:18.080
If that's not enough to bring it down...


01:19:18.080 --> 01:19:21.870
The Scout Regiment will throw
everything we have at it.


01:19:26.830 --> 01:19:28.080
Hey.


01:19:29.040 --> 01:19:32.500
The kids in this city remind me...


01:19:32.500 --> 01:19:34.870
...of us on that day.


01:19:36.830 --> 01:19:37.950
Yeah...


01:19:37.950 --> 01:19:43.500
Nobody thinks today is the day
a Titan bigger than the wall attacks.


01:19:44.500 --> 01:19:48.500
They might end up seeing
the same sight as we did that day.


01:19:48.500 --> 01:19:50.950
But there's one big difference.


01:19:50.950 --> 01:19:54.250
Atop the walls,
soldiers stand to face the Titan.


01:19:54.250 --> 01:19:56.950
And that would be us.


01:19:56.950 --> 01:19:59.750
Yeah, stack it up on the edge.


01:20:05.200 --> 01:20:06.450
Eren.


01:20:06.450 --> 01:20:09.950
There's no time to stop. Keep your hands busy.


01:20:13.620 --> 01:20:14.830
Eren!


01:20:15.910 --> 01:20:17.410
Wh-Whoa!


01:20:17.410 --> 01:20:19.580
What are you doing?!


01:20:19.580 --> 01:20:21.040
Making a wound?


01:20:21.040 --> 01:20:22.910
It's too early for that!


01:20:22.910 --> 01:20:24.120
No...


01:20:24.120 --> 01:20:27.410
Just beating the shit out of a useless brat.


01:20:27.410 --> 01:20:31.500
I hope he's dead and gone for good.


01:20:31.500 --> 01:20:32.950
Fire!


01:20:36.370 --> 01:20:40.040
Historia's become incredibly strong.


01:20:40.040 --> 01:20:43.660
I thought she was the weak one, but I was wrong.


01:20:43.660 --> 01:20:47.250
The weak one was me.


01:20:47.250 --> 01:20:48.790
Let the attack...


01:20:50.120 --> 01:20:51.660
...commence!


01:21:08.450 --> 01:21:09.750
Eren!


01:21:30.200 --> 01:21:34.410
All troops! Finish it off with ODM gear!


01:21:34.410 --> 01:21:36.040
It may be gigantic,


01:21:36.040 --> 01:21:40.080
but its vitals are still one meter high
and ten centimeters across.


01:21:40.080 --> 01:21:41.870
Unless we destroy the main body,


01:21:41.870 --> 01:21:45.790
it will regenerate and form
another shield of heat.


01:21:45.790 --> 01:21:47.370
We've only got one shot.


01:21:47.370 --> 01:21:48.500
Hot!


01:21:48.500 --> 01:21:51.620
Shit! Which is it?!


01:21:51.620 --> 01:21:53.580
Historia?!


01:21:53.580 --> 01:21:58.160
I understand your reasons, but...
I can't approve you entering combat.


01:21:58.160 --> 01:22:00.370
Commander, please!


01:22:00.370 --> 01:22:03.910
I've finally grasped the duty
I was meant to fulfill!


01:22:03.910 --> 01:22:06.950
That's why I'm here right now!


01:22:06.950 --> 01:22:11.080
I'm sorry for being so selfish.


01:22:11.080 --> 01:22:15.750
But this is the first time
I've gone against my parents...


01:22:15.750 --> 01:22:19.540
This is my first fight... with my father.


01:22:25.200 --> 01:22:26.370
Father!


01:22:26.370 --> 01:22:27.910
Listen to me, Father!


01:22:27.910 --> 01:22:29.700
--We can kill the Titans, once and for all!


01:22:29.700 --> 01:22:31.290
--You know I'll be fine, Brother.
--We can kill the Titans, once and for all!


01:22:31.290 --> 01:22:34.620
Alma, you're the only one who understands me...


01:22:34.620 --> 01:22:36.250
Oh, God...


01:22:54.120 --> 01:22:56.950
Were you the one who dealt the finishing blow?


01:22:58.410 --> 01:23:01.950
Was that all... my imagination?


01:23:01.950 --> 01:23:04.580
Am I... really...


01:23:04.580 --> 01:23:08.080
...acting on my own accord?


01:23:08.080 --> 01:23:10.120
But...


01:23:10.120 --> 01:23:12.790
The one always going with the flow is...


01:23:13.700 --> 01:23:15.950
...without a doubt, me.


01:23:17.700 --> 01:23:19.290
I am...


01:23:20.370 --> 01:23:23.500
I am Historia Reiss.


01:23:23.500 --> 01:23:26.040
The true ruler of the walls.


01:23:31.450 --> 01:23:32.750
Kenny.


01:23:39.200 --> 01:23:42.120
With those burns and that blood loss...


01:23:42.120 --> 01:23:45.040
...there's no helping you now.


01:23:47.580 --> 01:23:49.330
Yeah?


01:23:50.620 --> 01:23:52.450
I wonder...


01:23:55.620 --> 01:24:01.120
I swiped this little one right out of Rod's bag.


01:24:01.120 --> 01:24:07.160
Seems if I inject this...
I'll turn into a Titan.


01:24:07.160 --> 01:24:12.330
You've had the time and
strength to inject yourself.


01:24:12.330 --> 01:24:14.910
Why haven't you?


01:24:14.910 --> 01:24:19.290
Yeah... I... don't wanna die...


01:24:19.290 --> 01:24:21.750
...and wanted power.


01:24:23.290 --> 01:24:26.580
But... I see...


01:24:26.580 --> 01:24:27.950
Huh?


01:24:38.330 --> 01:24:43.500
Everybody I've met... was all the same.


01:24:44.700 --> 01:24:46.910
Drinking...


01:24:46.910 --> 01:24:49.040
Women...


01:24:49.040 --> 01:24:52.160
Worshiping God, even...


01:24:52.160 --> 01:24:59.330
Everyone had to be drunk on
somethin' to keep pushing on...


01:24:59.330 --> 01:25:03.870
Everyone... was a slave to somethin'.


01:25:03.870 --> 01:25:06.370
Even him...


01:25:13.830 --> 01:25:16.910
A-And what are you?


01:25:16.910 --> 01:25:18.830
A hero?!


01:25:20.950 --> 01:25:22.160
Kenny.


01:25:22.160 --> 01:25:24.700
Tell me everything you know!


01:25:24.700 --> 01:25:28.830
Why doesn't the First King
want humanity to survive?!


01:25:28.830 --> 01:25:31.160
Beats me...


01:25:31.160 --> 01:25:34.580
But... we Ackermann's...


01:25:34.580 --> 01:25:38.500
...opposed him... for that reason.


01:25:40.830 --> 01:25:44.450
My last name seems to be Ackermann, too.


01:25:44.450 --> 01:25:45.910
You...


01:25:45.910 --> 01:25:49.160
What were you to my mother?


01:25:49.160 --> 01:25:51.450
Heh, you idiot...


01:25:52.410 --> 01:25:55.160
Just her brother.


01:26:02.450 --> 01:26:05.750
That day... why?


01:26:05.750 --> 01:26:08.080
Why did you leave me?


01:26:12.700 --> 01:26:15.000
Because...


01:26:15.000 --> 01:26:18.330
...I'm not meant to be...


01:26:18.330 --> 01:26:21.040
...someone's father...


01:26:28.500 --> 01:26:31.750
{\an8}"2 Months Later"


01:26:33.250 --> 01:26:35.910
The final operation to retake Wall Maria...


01:26:35.910 --> 01:26:37.750
...will now commence!


01:26:40.540 --> 01:26:45.370
Now possessing the invaluable
weapon of Titan hardening,


01:26:45.370 --> 01:26:50.410
the Scouts returned to Shiganshina,
the place it all began.


01:26:50.410 --> 01:26:51.870
However...


01:27:05.580 --> 01:27:07.660
Keep on the lookout!


01:27:07.660 --> 01:27:09.700
Locate his allies!


01:27:17.330 --> 01:27:23.250
We're both hoping for the same thing--
to settle it here once and for all.


01:27:23.250 --> 01:27:25.500
Humanity or Titans?!


01:27:25.500 --> 01:27:29.450
Which side will live?! Which side will perish?!


01:27:29.450 --> 01:27:30.950
This is...


01:27:30.950 --> 01:27:32.250
...where I...


01:27:32.250 --> 01:27:35.450
...where we once called home!


01:27:35.450 --> 01:27:37.290
I'm taking it back!


01:27:37.290 --> 01:27:42.120
I'll slaughter you all...
and take back what you stole!


01:27:54.330 --> 01:27:56.910
Using the new Thunder Spears,


01:27:56.910 --> 01:28:00.750
the Scouts had driven the
Armored Titan into a corner,


01:28:00.750 --> 01:28:06.540
but the enemy's counterattack
was way beyond their expectations.


01:28:06.540 --> 01:28:07.910
The signal!


01:28:11.500 --> 01:28:12.500
Tsk!


01:28:16.370 --> 01:28:18.910
Reiner!


01:28:20.370 --> 01:28:21.750
Hange!


01:28:33.660 --> 01:28:34.950
Shit...


01:28:53.000 --> 01:28:56.290
Eren! Go stop his lanky legs!


01:28:59.250 --> 01:29:02.910
Armin, we need you to observe him from afar.


01:29:02.910 --> 01:29:05.870
We gotta believe there's a way to beat him!


01:29:05.870 --> 01:29:07.700
Now! Scatter!


01:29:17.160 --> 01:29:18.410
What?


01:29:24.910 --> 01:29:26.500
Eren!


01:29:28.410 --> 01:29:30.910
Hey! The horse got away!


01:29:30.910 --> 01:29:32.540
That was your job!


01:29:32.540 --> 01:29:34.830
Shut up! Like it matters?!


01:29:34.830 --> 01:29:36.620
Excuse me?!


01:29:36.620 --> 01:29:40.910
Those Scouts were insanely strong
and they died in an instant!


01:29:40.910 --> 01:29:43.410
You know as well as I do!


01:29:43.410 --> 01:29:46.200
What good is protecting horses...


01:29:46.200 --> 01:29:49.450
...when there's nobody left to ride them home?!


01:29:50.660 --> 01:29:56.620
If the plan goes well, you may be able
to take down the Beast Titan.


01:29:56.620 --> 01:29:58.620
But it will take the recruits...


01:29:58.620 --> 01:30:00.950
...and myself to give our lives.


01:30:05.910 --> 01:30:07.580
For this to work...


01:30:07.580 --> 01:30:10.160
To ask these young ones to die,


01:30:10.160 --> 01:30:15.000
it would take an expert con man
and a whole slew of lies.


01:30:15.000 --> 01:30:19.620
If I do not lead the vanguard,
none of them will follow.


01:30:19.620 --> 01:30:22.540
And I will die before anyone else.


01:30:22.540 --> 01:30:28.160
Without ever learning what's in the basement...


01:30:28.160 --> 01:30:29.500
Huh?


01:30:36.660 --> 01:30:38.370
I...


01:30:38.370 --> 01:30:40.790
I want to go to the basement.


01:30:41.700 --> 01:30:44.200
Everything I've done till now...


01:30:44.200 --> 01:30:47.200
...was because I thought this day would come.


01:30:48.410 --> 01:30:50.040
But, Levi...


01:30:51.910 --> 01:30:55.080
Can you see them? Our comrades?


01:30:58.660 --> 01:31:01.620
Our comrades are looking at us.


01:31:01.620 --> 01:31:05.200
They want to know what became
of the hearts they gave.


01:31:09.450 --> 01:31:12.330
You've fought well.


01:31:12.330 --> 01:31:15.950
It's all thanks to you that we've come this far.


01:31:17.660 --> 01:31:19.830
I'm making the choice.


01:31:21.540 --> 01:31:24.200
Give up on your dream and die.


01:31:24.200 --> 01:31:27.540
Lead the recruits straight into hell.


01:31:27.540 --> 01:31:30.910
I will take down the Beast Titan.


01:31:35.580 --> 01:31:37.790
Charge!


01:31:40.700 --> 01:31:42.750
A suicide charge?


01:31:42.750 --> 01:31:47.000
Here I was thinking they could
do better than that...


01:31:47.000 --> 01:31:49.450
Now! Fire!


01:31:53.620 --> 01:31:56.160
I'm announcing our final operation!


01:31:56.160 --> 01:32:01.040
We'll wait until he's ready to throw
and fire our smoke signals together.


01:32:01.040 --> 01:32:04.370
That should reduce his accuracy somewhat.


01:32:04.370 --> 01:32:09.830
While we're acting as a decoy,
Captain Levi will kill the Beast Titan.


01:32:09.830 --> 01:32:12.330
That is our plan.


01:32:12.330 --> 01:32:13.660
What?


01:32:13.660 --> 01:32:17.160
You want me to go after him with just ODM gear?


01:32:17.160 --> 01:32:19.370
He's standing in an empty area.


01:32:19.370 --> 01:32:22.410
There's not even a house or tree in sight.


01:32:22.410 --> 01:32:23.790
Wrong...


01:32:24.750 --> 01:32:28.950
There happens to be a line of objects
at just the right height.


01:32:30.370 --> 01:32:33.160
Sneak close using the Titans...


01:32:33.160 --> 01:32:35.660
...and assassinate the Beast Titan.


01:32:42.830 --> 01:32:45.290
I'm sorry...


01:32:45.290 --> 01:32:50.580
We die trusting the living who follow
to find meaning in our lives!


01:32:50.580 --> 01:32:56.660
That is the sole method in which
we can rebel against this cruel world!


01:32:56.660 --> 01:32:58.870
My soldiers, rage!


01:32:58.870 --> 01:33:01.120
My soldiers, scream!


01:33:01.120 --> 01:33:04.200
My soldiers, fight!


01:33:13.410 --> 01:33:15.160
I have a plan.


01:33:15.160 --> 01:33:17.620
You all need to draw Reiner away.


01:33:17.620 --> 01:33:20.830
Eren and I will defeat Bertholdt ourselves.


01:33:21.750 --> 01:33:25.160
The two of us can win and I'm going to prove it.


01:33:26.950 --> 01:33:28.160
All right.


01:33:28.160 --> 01:33:29.410
Hmm?


01:33:30.700 --> 01:33:32.410
What's that?


01:33:32.410 --> 01:33:34.950
My Titans have fallen...


01:33:48.540 --> 01:33:50.120
Huh?


01:33:50.120 --> 01:33:52.790
I need to watch out for a single soldier?


01:33:52.790 --> 01:33:56.580
Yes. Captain Levi is dangerous.


01:33:56.580 --> 01:33:58.750
Is this Levi?


01:33:59.950 --> 01:34:01.160
My nape!


01:34:03.540 --> 01:34:04.950
What the--?


01:34:04.950 --> 01:34:06.750
I can't see a thing!


01:34:07.660 --> 01:34:09.540
Did he take out my eyes?


01:34:11.160 --> 01:34:12.500
My legs!


01:34:14.040 --> 01:34:17.040
What happened to all that fun you were having?!


01:34:17.040 --> 01:34:19.000
Tsk! I'll harden!


01:34:19.000 --> 01:34:20.410
Shoot, I won't make it!


01:34:20.410 --> 01:34:23.160
Come on, let's try to enjoy this!


01:34:40.120 --> 01:34:43.830
Isn't anyone out there still alive?


01:34:43.830 --> 01:34:50.450
If they are, even on the brink of death,
this injection will make them a Titan.


01:35:01.330 --> 01:35:05.200
For some reason,
when I think of the outside world...


01:35:05.200 --> 01:35:07.620
...courage flows through me.


01:35:14.040 --> 01:35:15.750
Eren, wake up!


01:35:18.330 --> 01:35:20.500
Let's go look at the sea!


01:35:30.580 --> 01:35:32.500
Wait...


01:35:32.500 --> 01:35:35.950
I made a promise to him...


01:35:35.950 --> 01:35:38.910
...that I'd kill you no matter what.


01:35:39.910 --> 01:35:41.830
I promised!


01:35:54.910 --> 01:35:56.370
Shit...


01:36:02.830 --> 01:36:04.250
Eren!


01:36:14.950 --> 01:36:16.830
Armin...


01:36:16.830 --> 01:36:19.750
All the way to the very end...


01:36:19.750 --> 01:36:21.750
...you fought well.


01:36:29.830 --> 01:36:31.450
Why?


01:36:31.450 --> 01:36:33.660
I can't blow Armin away...


01:36:34.910 --> 01:36:36.620
I knew it...


01:36:36.620 --> 01:36:39.000
His bones aren't being consumed!


01:36:39.000 --> 01:36:41.790
The anchors stay put if they're not in muscle!


01:36:41.790 --> 01:36:47.660
But most importantly, he can't move
his body while he's emitting steam!


01:36:47.660 --> 01:36:51.870
But, Armin... is this how you go out?


01:36:51.870 --> 01:36:55.750
In all your wisdom, the best plan
you could come up with...


01:36:55.750 --> 01:37:00.330
...was to get scorched to death like this?


01:37:00.330 --> 01:37:04.450
I can't breathe! I have to let go...


01:37:04.450 --> 01:37:06.660
No! Not yet!


01:37:06.660 --> 01:37:09.000
It's not enough!


01:37:09.000 --> 01:37:12.370
I've gotta buy more time!


01:37:12.370 --> 01:37:15.700
What's he trying to accomplish? A diversion?


01:37:15.700 --> 01:37:19.040
But Eren's still beat to a pulp over there.


01:37:20.000 --> 01:37:22.290
I'll make it quick for you.


01:37:25.660 --> 01:37:27.450
Hold on!


01:37:27.450 --> 01:37:29.950
Don't let go!


01:37:29.950 --> 01:37:32.330
I entrust it to Eren!


01:37:32.330 --> 01:37:36.790
My dreams... My life... Everything!


01:37:36.790 --> 01:37:42.250
This is the one and only thing I have to give!


01:37:42.250 --> 01:37:44.410
I'm sure...


01:37:44.410 --> 01:37:46.580
...Eren will...


01:37:46.580 --> 01:37:49.750
...reach... the sea...!


01:37:51.370 --> 01:37:52.910
He'll look at...


01:37:54.700 --> 01:37:56.660
...the sea for me!


01:37:59.870 --> 01:38:01.500
It's over...


01:38:05.750 --> 01:38:07.410
Hardening...?


01:38:13.830 --> 01:38:15.290
Gotcha!


01:38:47.790 --> 01:38:50.910
Eren... You should know.


01:38:50.910 --> 01:38:54.200
We promised to go to the sea together, right?


01:38:54.200 --> 01:38:57.160
Have I ever lied to you in my life?


01:39:03.950 --> 01:39:05.410
Armin...


01:39:06.500 --> 01:39:10.160
Why... don't you run away?


01:39:15.790 --> 01:39:17.500
A Titan?


01:39:21.200 --> 01:39:23.500
You just try coming closer!


01:39:23.500 --> 01:39:26.660
Make one move to take him and he's dead!


01:39:30.700 --> 01:39:33.080
Are you...


01:39:33.080 --> 01:39:35.620
...Eren Jaeger?


01:39:35.620 --> 01:39:38.410
If nothing else, I'm taking him with me!


01:39:38.410 --> 01:39:41.500
You look nothing like your father.


01:39:43.080 --> 01:39:45.120
My... dad?


01:39:47.660 --> 01:39:50.620
Argh... You're kidding me!


01:39:50.620 --> 01:39:53.000
He chased me all the way here?


01:39:53.950 --> 01:39:58.000
Eren! Someday, I'm coming back to rescue you!


01:40:02.870 --> 01:40:04.500
He ran?


01:40:07.700 --> 01:40:09.370
Captain!


01:40:09.370 --> 01:40:11.250
That was the last of my gas.


01:40:11.250 --> 01:40:14.000
I'll chase him! Hand over your gas and blades!


01:40:14.000 --> 01:40:14.950
Right!


01:40:14.950 --> 01:40:16.200
Hurry!


01:40:23.950 --> 01:40:26.120
Today, I would like to explain...


01:40:26.120 --> 01:40:30.290
...how we're going to get maximum
value from this injection.


01:40:31.200 --> 01:40:34.080
The one injected with this will become a Titan,


01:40:34.080 --> 01:40:38.040
and eat someone who can change
into a Titan like Eren can.


01:40:38.040 --> 01:40:42.700
By doing so, although they would initially
be a Titan lacking intelligence,


01:40:42.700 --> 01:40:47.580
they would revert into a human
able to wield that Titan's powers.


01:40:47.580 --> 01:40:54.000
Furthermore, we'll be able to revive
a person on the brink of death.


01:40:55.500 --> 01:40:58.040
We have only this one injection.


01:40:58.040 --> 01:41:01.870
I'm entrusting the call to
use it with Captain Levi.


01:41:03.540 --> 01:41:05.830
Yeah! Keep it up!


01:41:07.830 --> 01:41:10.370
Armin's breathing again!


01:41:11.750 --> 01:41:15.250
Come on! Just keep on breathing!


01:41:16.700 --> 01:41:18.160
Armin?


01:41:18.160 --> 01:41:20.950
Captain! Get the syringe!


01:41:23.540 --> 01:41:27.580
Make Armin into a Titan
and we'll have him eat Bertholdt!


01:41:27.580 --> 01:41:29.830
Hurry up and inject him!


01:41:32.290 --> 01:41:33.620
Yeah...


01:41:36.500 --> 01:41:39.540
Captain... Levi...


01:41:39.540 --> 01:41:42.160
I finally found you.


01:41:42.160 --> 01:41:44.830
Commander Erwin is badly wounded!


01:41:44.830 --> 01:41:48.620
His stomach is gouged...
and his organs are demolished!


01:41:48.620 --> 01:41:51.410
The blood just won't stop!


01:41:51.410 --> 01:41:54.870
I thought that injection might
be able to help, but...


01:41:54.870 --> 01:41:56.410
What do you think?


01:42:02.200 --> 01:42:03.500
Huh?


01:42:14.410 --> 01:42:17.620
I'm using the injection... on Erwin.


01:42:41.620 --> 01:42:44.040
You should know as well as I do!


01:42:44.040 --> 01:42:48.580
Without Erwin's talent,
humanity can't beat the Titans!


01:42:48.580 --> 01:42:53.950
It's... no different if we lose... Armin.


01:42:53.950 --> 01:42:55.410
Eren!


01:42:55.410 --> 01:42:59.330
Hasn't it... always been like that?


01:42:59.330 --> 01:43:03.540
He's the reason why we saved Trost
by plugging it with a rock.


01:43:03.540 --> 01:43:06.250
He revealed Annie's identity.


01:43:06.250 --> 01:43:08.910
The only reason we defeated Bertholdt...


01:43:08.910 --> 01:43:12.370
...was all because of Armin!


01:43:12.370 --> 01:43:16.500
The one who's gonna save humanity
isn't me or the commander!


01:43:16.500 --> 01:43:18.200
It's Armin!


01:43:19.540 --> 01:43:23.830
The one who will save humanity...
is Commander Erwin.


01:43:23.830 --> 01:43:29.120
When I found the commander alive,
I was about to finish him off.


01:43:30.750 --> 01:43:36.000
But... that's going too easy on him.


01:43:36.000 --> 01:43:40.450
I thought to myself that he ought
to taste more of this hell.


01:43:44.950 --> 01:43:46.330
Hange...


01:43:50.370 --> 01:43:55.080
Hey... You've got to be... kidding me...


01:43:55.080 --> 01:43:56.790
No way...


01:44:00.830 --> 01:44:02.660
Captain...


01:44:03.750 --> 01:44:08.790
Do you... know about... the sea?


01:44:08.790 --> 01:44:13.830
No matter how far you look,
it stretches past the horizon.


01:44:13.830 --> 01:44:16.660
It's a gigantic lake.


01:44:17.660 --> 01:44:18.620
Armin said--


01:44:18.620 --> 01:44:21.500
Hey! Cut it out!


01:44:21.500 --> 01:44:24.750
There's a sea beyond the walls...


01:44:24.750 --> 01:44:28.410
...and he said we'd go there together!


01:44:28.410 --> 01:44:31.330
Armin cares about more than just fighting!


01:44:31.330 --> 01:44:33.660
He has dreams!


01:44:37.330 --> 01:44:39.660
Everyone get out of here!


01:44:39.660 --> 01:44:43.620
I'm going to have Erwin eat Bertholdt!


01:44:45.040 --> 01:44:47.790
Come on. Let's go, Mikasa.


01:44:56.410 --> 01:44:59.830
Let's start by seeing the sea!


01:44:59.830 --> 01:45:02.950
You'll see! It does exist!


01:45:09.330 --> 01:45:11.500
I...


01:45:11.500 --> 01:45:14.080
I want to go to the basement.


01:45:15.120 --> 01:45:17.000
Good grief.


01:45:17.000 --> 01:45:20.160
They're all the same...


01:45:20.160 --> 01:45:23.200
Whining like brats one after another...


01:45:23.200 --> 01:45:30.040
Everyone had to be drunk on
somethin' to keep pushing on...


01:45:30.040 --> 01:45:35.000
Everyone... was a slave to somethin'.


01:45:35.000 --> 01:45:37.410
But there's more than that.


01:45:37.410 --> 01:45:39.160
The sea...


01:45:46.410 --> 01:45:48.870
Erwin!


01:45:48.870 --> 01:45:51.120
Teacher...


01:45:51.120 --> 01:45:55.540
How do we know there're not more humans...


01:45:55.540 --> 01:45:59.040
...outside the walls?


01:46:07.750 --> 01:46:09.700
Levi...


01:46:09.700 --> 01:46:11.450
Thank you.


01:46:26.540 --> 01:46:27.870
Captain...


01:46:27.870 --> 01:46:31.330
Why... did you...?


01:46:31.330 --> 01:46:36.120
Do you think... you can forgive him?


01:46:36.120 --> 01:46:39.250
He had no choice but to become a devil.


01:46:40.370 --> 01:46:43.120
It was us who wished for that.


01:46:44.080 --> 01:46:49.160
And in the end, when he had
finally been set free from hell,


01:46:49.160 --> 01:46:53.000
we wanted to bring him back once more.


01:46:53.000 --> 01:46:57.450
But I think... it's time to let him rest.


01:47:00.290 --> 01:47:03.660
Why... did you pick me?


01:47:04.580 --> 01:47:06.830
No matter how you look at it,


01:47:06.830 --> 01:47:10.950
wasn't Commander Erwin
the right one to bring back?


01:47:10.950 --> 01:47:14.370
The final decision to choose you was mine.


01:47:14.370 --> 01:47:15.790
No...


01:47:15.790 --> 01:47:19.830
I chose this to be the place where Erwin dies.


01:47:20.950 --> 01:47:23.080
I...


01:47:23.080 --> 01:47:25.660
...have a dream.


01:47:25.660 --> 01:47:28.830
One I've had since I was a child...


01:47:28.830 --> 01:47:32.580
There will come a moment when
we learn the truth of our world...


01:47:32.580 --> 01:47:34.950
...and I must be there for it.


01:47:34.950 --> 01:47:38.410
Is it that important to you?


01:47:38.410 --> 01:47:40.330
More than your legs?


01:47:40.330 --> 01:47:41.950
Yes.


01:47:41.950 --> 01:47:44.950
More than humanity's victory?


01:47:44.950 --> 01:47:46.500
Yes.


01:47:52.660 --> 01:47:54.120
Right here.


01:47:54.120 --> 01:47:56.830
Under this are the stairs to the basement.


01:47:56.830 --> 01:47:58.250
Good.


01:48:04.660 --> 01:48:06.040
It opened.


01:48:07.330 --> 01:48:10.950
This is... a portrait?


01:48:10.950 --> 01:48:12.580
Let me see that.


01:48:14.080 --> 01:48:16.540
That's Dr. Jaeger's writing.


01:48:18.410 --> 01:48:20.540
"This is no illustration.


01:48:20.540 --> 01:48:24.370
Instead, this uses light
reflected off a subject


01:48:24.370 --> 01:48:27.500
and burns the image on special paper.


01:48:27.500 --> 01:48:30.160
It's called a photograph.


01:48:30.160 --> 01:48:31.620
I come from a place"...


01:48:31.620 --> 01:48:35.620
...outside the walls where
humanity lives in elegance.


01:48:36.750 --> 01:48:39.700
Humanity has not perished.


01:48:40.700 --> 01:48:45.000
I was born into a race known as "Eldian."


01:48:45.000 --> 01:48:48.910
Our ancestor Ymir Fritz obtained
the Power of the Titans


01:48:48.910 --> 01:48:51.660
and tyrannized other peoples.


01:48:51.660 --> 01:48:57.200
But 80 years ago, the once-great nation
of Marley won the Great Titan War...


01:48:57.200 --> 01:49:00.620
...and the Empire of Eldia collapsed.


01:49:00.620 --> 01:49:06.910
The empire's King Fritz built three huge
walls on their territory of Paradis


01:49:06.910 --> 01:49:10.200
and took refuge there with his people.


01:49:10.200 --> 01:49:12.910
However, not all of them came.


01:49:12.910 --> 01:49:17.250
The remaining Eldians
abandoned on the mainland


01:49:17.250 --> 01:49:21.500
were put in internment zones
and discriminated against.


01:49:21.500 --> 01:49:24.500
In time, I became a member


01:49:24.500 --> 01:49:29.200
of a revolutionary group called
the "Eldian Restorationists."


01:49:29.200 --> 01:49:34.540
That is where I met Dina Fritz,
a woman of royal blood,


01:49:34.540 --> 01:49:38.000
who blessed me with a son, Zeke.


01:49:38.000 --> 01:49:44.700
And so, in order to restore the empire,
I raised Zeke to be a Marleyan warrior


01:49:44.700 --> 01:49:49.450
in a plot for him to inherit the Seven Titans.


01:49:49.450 --> 01:49:54.500
However, Zeke betrayed us.


01:49:54.500 --> 01:49:56.080
We're here.


01:49:57.910 --> 01:50:00.950
This is... paradise.


01:50:00.950 --> 01:50:02.370
That's right.


01:50:02.370 --> 01:50:06.660
The penal colony of Eldian
traitors: Paradis Island.


01:50:06.660 --> 01:50:09.540
This is where you'll serve your life sentence.


01:50:09.540 --> 01:50:12.000
As a Pure Titan, that is.


01:50:25.660 --> 01:50:28.950
My comrades were turned into Titans.


01:50:28.950 --> 01:50:31.870
And then, Dina, too.


01:50:34.660 --> 01:50:37.870
Grisha, I...


01:50:37.870 --> 01:50:42.950
No matter what form I take,
I promise I'll come and find you.


01:50:42.950 --> 01:50:46.450
Dina!


01:50:57.700 --> 01:51:00.080
Eren, calm down.


01:51:00.080 --> 01:51:01.950
You're in the stockades.


01:51:01.950 --> 01:51:05.250
You and Mikasa are serving time
for insubordination.


01:51:05.250 --> 01:51:08.540
Were you having a nightmare, Eren?


01:51:08.540 --> 01:51:11.870
Yeah... I was...


01:51:11.870 --> 01:51:17.120
I feel like... I just woke up
from the longest dream ever.


01:51:19.080 --> 01:51:22.620
No, not a dream...


01:51:22.620 --> 01:51:24.200
Memories...


01:51:25.330 --> 01:51:27.330
That Titan...


01:51:27.330 --> 01:51:29.410
It was you...


01:51:31.040 --> 01:51:32.790
Dina...


01:51:39.830 --> 01:51:44.290
That day, I met the informant
who posed as a Marleyan officer...


01:51:44.290 --> 01:51:47.410
...and leaked information
to the Restorationists.


01:51:47.410 --> 01:51:52.700
From this man named the "Owl,"
I inherited Titan powers.


01:51:55.200 --> 01:52:00.450
If the Founding Titan falls into
Marleyan hands, Eldia is done for.


01:52:01.500 --> 01:52:04.950
The King in the walls wouldn't
allow that to happen.


01:52:04.950 --> 01:52:07.000
The King in the walls won't fight.


01:52:07.000 --> 01:52:08.160
Huh?


01:52:09.120 --> 01:52:11.870
The King of the walls stole
his people's memories


01:52:11.870 --> 01:52:16.540
and made them believe humanity
perished beyond the walls.


01:52:16.540 --> 01:52:21.660
You must find that cowardly King
and strip him of the Founding Titan.


01:52:21.660 --> 01:52:24.330
That is our mission.


01:52:25.580 --> 01:52:28.410
Mr. Jaeger later achieved his mission


01:52:28.410 --> 01:52:32.410
and entrusted the Founding
Titan to his son Eren.


01:52:32.410 --> 01:52:38.200
Eren was able to control Pure Titans
in the past to escape a dire situation.


01:52:38.200 --> 01:52:45.290
So it may be possible, even without royal blood,
for Eren to wield that power as well.


01:52:45.290 --> 01:52:47.660
That's right...


01:52:47.660 --> 01:52:52.040
Just for that split second,
it felt like everything connected.


01:52:54.500 --> 01:52:57.250
My name is Dina Fritz.


01:52:57.250 --> 01:53:00.330
I'm a descendant of the royal family.


01:53:00.330 --> 01:53:04.040
If someone with royal blood
is made into a Titan that I touch,


01:53:04.040 --> 01:53:08.620
it might be possible for me to use
the Founding Titan's powers.


01:53:08.620 --> 01:53:12.040
That's right... It's just a possibility...


01:53:12.040 --> 01:53:17.700
But if they knew of that possibility,
what would the military do to Historia?


01:53:20.580 --> 01:53:24.830
Six years after the Colossal
Titan's first attack...


01:53:25.790 --> 01:53:29.750
Refugees were permitted
to return to their hometowns


01:53:29.750 --> 01:53:35.290
and the Scouts once again resumed
expeditions past Wall Maria.


01:53:40.040 --> 01:53:42.000
Have a family.


01:53:42.000 --> 01:53:43.040
Huh?


01:53:43.040 --> 01:53:46.500
Your wife, your child,
your neighbors if need be...


01:53:46.500 --> 01:53:49.040
Love someone inside the walls.


01:53:50.870 --> 01:53:53.950
If you can't do that, it'll only repeat.


01:53:53.950 --> 01:53:58.870
The same history... The same
mistakes... Over and over...


01:53:58.870 --> 01:54:04.500
To save Mikasa, Armin, and everyone
else, you must see it through.


01:54:04.500 --> 01:54:09.160
Mikasa? Armin? Who is that?


01:54:09.160 --> 01:54:12.580
Who knows? I'm not sure...


01:54:12.580 --> 01:54:14.660
Whose memories are those?


01:54:23.370 --> 01:54:28.120
This is the place where Eldians
were made into Titans.


01:54:28.120 --> 01:54:31.080
And... beyond that...


01:54:47.080 --> 01:54:49.120
Look!


01:54:49.120 --> 01:54:51.870
I told you, Eren!


01:54:51.870 --> 01:54:55.290
A salt lake so big that merchants
could spend their whole lives


01:54:55.290 --> 01:54:58.580
and still not get all the salt.


01:54:58.580 --> 01:55:02.750
The stuff I talked about wasn't wrong after all!


01:55:04.910 --> 01:55:06.750
Yeah...


01:55:06.750 --> 01:55:10.000
It's so damn big...


01:55:13.620 --> 01:55:16.660
Look, Eren! On the other side of the wall--


01:55:16.660 --> 01:55:18.580
There's a sea.


01:55:21.370 --> 01:55:25.700
On the other side of the sea... is freedom.


01:55:27.790 --> 01:55:30.700
That's what I always believed.


01:55:35.160 --> 01:55:37.410
But I was wrong.


01:55:38.620 --> 01:55:43.950
On the other side of the sea... are enemies.


01:55:43.950 --> 01:55:49.540
Every part of this is exactly how
I saw it in my dad's memories.


01:55:57.580 --> 01:55:59.040
Hey...


01:56:01.160 --> 01:56:06.250
If we kill all our enemies... over there...


01:56:06.250 --> 01:56:10.540
...will we finally... be free?

